ooks I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T00:48:01-07:00","id":954876,"title":"","content":"I'm glad, this a cool idea for a game. Has anyone done any art for it? You should pitch it to Onyx Path, they said they are interested in fan projects. I am glad your planning on a PDF, it's harder to read without one, at least as a person that likes to read overtime.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12094,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12094-k9ine","user":"K9ine","date":". 08-21-2016, 03:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12094-k9ine","name":"K9ine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12094_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T01:42:57-07:00","id":954888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>K9ine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=954876#post954876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone done any art for it?</div> </div> </div> </div> I got permission from a couple of artists to use their stuff, no one's doing art speciffically for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T03:25:16-07:00","id":954900,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I whipeed up a quick intro.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:24px\">Introduction</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Nothing beside remains. Round the decay</span></i></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Of that colossal wreck, boundless and bare</span></i></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The lone and level sands stretch far away.</span></i></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2015 Percy Bysshe Shelley, Ozymandias</span></i></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Your world ended long before you were born. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Once the ancient gods used mankind as they pleased and basked in the worship of their slaves, but those days are past. Mankind turned upon their gods and slew them upon their thrones. Their idols were cast down, their temples looted, and their rituals were ended. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">In their victory mankind has created wonders. Civilisation stretches across the world. Laws bring safety and unity to the masses while science and reason birth extraordinary new devices and ever greater understanding of the universe. New gods have claimed the empty thrones, their theologies are debated and interpreted by sages and philosophers questing for morality and meaning. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">In the shadow of this great age all that remains of the world before is a few fragments of broken idols and ruined temples buried, forgotten, in the silt and muck of the sea floor.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">And you.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">You are a descendent of the old gods, the original gods. Their seed lies in all of humanity and it took root in you. You have inherited their divine power, an ancient primordial power to large and chaotic to fit into this modern ordered world. Your very existence shakes the foundations of morality and civilisation, your presence alone drags men back to their primordial roots, exposing the savage ape buried beneath every civilised person. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">There is little room for you in this new world, but there are hidden places on the fringes where you can live and claim your birthright. But never for eternity. Mankind will not suffer your existence lightly, and they\u2019ve had millennia to learn your ways and muster their forces. You can run, and fight with your own kin over the shrinking scraps of land where your kind can still hide. Or you can rise up against humanity. The odds are against you, victory may be too horrific to contemplate, but you are divine and for you nothing is impossible. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">You could devour the world. </span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-21T08:37:46-07:00","id":954962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=954900#post954900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I whipeed up a quick intro.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:24px\">Introduction</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Nothing beside remains. Round the decay</span></i></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Of that colossal wreck, boundless and bare</span></i></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The lone and level sands stretch far away.</span></i></span></span></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2015 Percy Bysshe Shelley, Ozymandias</span></i></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Your world ended long before you were born. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Once the ancient gods used mankind as they pleased and basked in the worship of their slaves, but those days are past. Mankind turned upon their gods and slew them upon their thrones. Their idols were cast down, their temples looted, and their rituals were ended. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">In their victory mankind has created wonders. Civilisation stretches across the world. Laws bring safety and unity to the masses while science and reason birth extraordinary new devices and ever greater understanding of the universe. New gods have claimed the empty thrones, their theologies are debated and interpreted by sages and philosophers questing for morality and meaning. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">In the shadow of this great age all that remains of the world before is a few fragments of broken idols and ruined temples buried, forgotten, in the silt and muck of the sea floor.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">And you.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">You are a descendent of the old gods, the original gods. Their seed lies in all of humanity and it took root in you. You have inherited their divine power, an ancient primordial power to large and chaotic to fit into this modern ordered world. Your very existence shakes the foundations of morality and civilisation, your presence alone drags men back to their primordial roots, exposing the savage ape buried beneath every civilised person. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">There is little room for you in this new world, but there are hidden places on the fringes where you can live and claim your birthright. But never for eternity. Mankind will not suffer your existence lightly, and they\u2019ve had millennia to learn your ways and muster their forces. You can run, and fight with your own kin over the shrinking scraps of land where your kind can still hide. Or you can rise up against humanity. The odds are against you, victory may be too horrific to contemplate, but you are divine and for you nothing is impossible. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">You could devour the world. </span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Short and concise, honestly better that some of the official introductions. I feel like this is the one splat idea that is missing from CofD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12094-k9ine","name":"K9ine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12094_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T12:06:16-07:00","id":957762,"title":"","content":"When can we expect experience cost for this conversion? you've got nearly everything we need, but no information on how much channels cost.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew thought process.<br /> &quot;I have this great idea for a power/splat/merit/etc/&quot;<br /> &quot;I have no idea if this is balanced, useless, or gamebreaking.&quot;<br /> &quot;I'll ask the internet&quot;<br /> &quot;The thread has died.&quot; <img src=\"images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4226-spiderlord","name":"Spiderlord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T12:51:19-07:00","id":957784,"title":"","content":"Here you go <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><ul><li>Channel in favoured Vestige: 8</li> <li>Channel in other Vestige: 10</li> <li>Adaptation: 2 * dots</li> <li>Favoured Adaptation: Dots</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T13:51:22-07:00","id":957829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=957784#post957784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here you go <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><ul><li>Channel in favoured Vestige: 8</li> <li>Channel in other Vestige: 10</li> <li>Adaptation: 2 * dots</li> <li>Favoured Adaptation: Dots</li> </ul><br /> </div> </div> </div> </div>That's... a lot of XPs. Power Stats only cost 5 per dot in 2E now, and a Channel costs just-under to outright-double that?<br /> <br /> Deliberate, because Channels package 7 powers in 1 (effectively)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 08-25-2016, 04:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T14:25:03-07:00","id":957843,"title":"","content":"It's deliberate, Channels are arguably even more powerful than Utterances (especially since you get to keep their top tier abilities for good) and an Utterance was 15 exp, twice the 8 exp for a 1E Power Stat. So I used that as a guide.<br /> <br /> I gave Channels a small discount by making Favoured 8 rather than Unfavoured 12, but that was just because it felt a bit high to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T14:40:45-07:00","id":957850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=957843#post957843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's deliberate, Channels are arguably even more powerful than Utterances (especially since you get to keep their top tier abilities for good) and an Utterance was 15 exp, twice the 8 exp for a 1E Power Stat. So I used that as a guide.<br /> <br /> I gave Channels a small discount by making Favoured 8 rather than Unfavoured 12, but that was just because it felt a bit high to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering how they've been built up, developing a new Channel is about equivalent in power and breadth to a whole weak template in itself, so double a point of Powerstat sounds about fair.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":4488,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","user":"malonkey1","date":". 08-25-2016, 05:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T12:44:59-07:00","id":962447,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=957784#post957784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here you go <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><ul><li>Channel in favoured Vestige: 8</li> <li>Channel in other Vestige: 10</li> <li>Adaptation: 2 * dots</li> <li>Favoured Adaptation: Dots</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>one problem. The adaptations in first edition cost the same as merits, with a small discount for favored. these only cost the same as merits if favored, otherwise they cost twice as much.<br /> also, on an unrelated note, will their be any channels or adaptations to allow a leviathan to walk on land in apotheosis? I want to go godzilla.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew thought process.<br /> &quot;I have this great idea for a power/splat/merit/etc/&quot;<br /> &quot;I have no idea if this is balanced, useless, or gamebreaking.&quot;<br /> &quot;I'll ask the internet&quot;<br /> &quot;The thread has died.&quot; <img src=\"images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4226-spiderlord","name":"Spiderlord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T13:24:08-07:00","id":962464,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spiderlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=962447#post962447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">one problem. The adaptations in first edition cost the same as merits, with a small discount for favored. these only cost the same as merits if favored, otherwise they cost twice as much.<br /> also, on an unrelated note, will their be any channels or adaptations to allow a leviathan to walk on land in apotheosis? I want to go godzilla.</div> </div> </div> </div>Full on land is probably not thematic, but something to extend the time before you start taking penalties/losing Ichor might be okay?<br /> <br /> So, Godzilla in short bursts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-03T00:02:15-07:00","id":962733,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spiderlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=962447#post962447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">one problem. The adaptations in first edition cost the same as merits, with a small discount for favored. these only cost the same as merits if favored, otherwise they cost twice as much.</div> </div> </div> </div> I felt they were a bit underpriced.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spiderlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=962447#post962447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">also, on an unrelated note, will their be any channels or adaptations to allow a leviathan to walk on land in apotheosis? I want to go godzilla.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope, you have to stay in the water and attack skyscrapers with really long arms instead. Leviathans do have a Channel that lets them expand rivers so they can swim up smaller ones though, so a city like London would be really vunerable to godzilla attacks.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-04T00:58:05-07:00","id":963124,"title":"","content":"The alpha draft of chapter 1 is complete:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AV882J348FbbqntgQwNIFqtk2twTHpYXkvKMZwB8vKQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> I'd completely forgotten that 1E assumed that a Leviathan would actually have a job and pay for a house and food. Suffice to say that's rare outside the School of Clay now, and even Clay will take frequent breaks by having cultists step in to cover their shift.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&am