nels?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew thought process.<br /> &quot;I have this great idea for a power/splat/merit/etc/&quot;<br /> &quot;I have no idea if this is balanced, useless, or gamebreaking.&quot;<br /> &quot;I'll ask the internet&quot;<br /> &quot;The thread has died.&quot; <img src=\"images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4226-spiderlord","name":"Spiderlord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-07T14:38:55-07:00","id":983539,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spiderlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=983532#post983532\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apologies if this question has already been asked, but how do atavisms intersect with attribute boosting channels?</div> </div> </div> </div>They don't, on account of the Attribute Boosting Channels getting dropped, I believe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0