 boxes total so the middle two boxes can potentially belong to either.<br /> <br /> Willpower: This would need a second set of dots in brackets (like Princess has)<br /> <br /> Size could be split into 6 different numbers; but that might not be worth the effort.<br /> The Ripple Effect should be included with Size, it's just a space to write a number.<br /> For Health I'd suggest having space to write numbers rather than boxes. Since Size is health Leviathans can get enormous health quite easily.<br /> <br /> <br /> For supernatural powers Leviathans have 4:<br /> <br /> Atavisms: Which can be lesser, greater, or ancient. The theoretical maximum is to have 2/3/2 atavisms and each Atavism is linked to an Attribute. You can have multiple Atavisms for a single attribute.<br /> <br /> Channels/Birthright. These are simply a you have them or you don't.<br /> <br /> Adaptations: These have a dot rating and are always associated with a Channel.<br /> <br /> Codified Rituals: In a word, Mage Rotes.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Leviathan sheet will definitely need space for a Cult. The Cult should have the following traits:<br /> <br /> Name<br /> Structure (one of eight options)<br /> Fervour rated 1 - 7<br /> Piety rated 1 - 7<br /> Zeal rated 1 - 5<br /> Space for the Cult's Merits<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> For the general look, well I'm not sure if this is practical, but I imagined a sort of dishevelled academia look. As though this were one of H.P. Lovecraft's half mad investigator's research notes. The colour scheme is a watery blue/green - like the opening picture in <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ISiYxINVYvbHsFDcXKopDS8Lxwa0RzNIVgIWQcjg5Qw/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...WQcjg5Qw/edit#</a><br /> <br /> Let me know if you have any more questions?</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I'll add this to my list. Not exactly sure when I can start on it, but should I have any questions once I do, I'll send them your way.<br /> <br /> Seems like you covered everything. The only issue I might have is with borders and such, since I'm not that great at designing my own...but, I'll see what I can do. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-25T09:15:04-08:00","id":1008126,"title":"","content":"Sorry if this was already brought up but what is the example setting here? I would imagine coastal Maine myself given its geography and history.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12243-dreaming-cat","name":"Dreaming Cat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-25T10:52:11-08:00","id":1008192,"title":"","content":"Example settings are a ton of work and not fully necessary, so I don't plan to do one.<br /> <br /> 1E had an unfinished San Diego and Tijuana as the sample setting. There were some good ideas there, with a theme of neither city being able to exist without the other but also having conflicting fear and envy of the land across the border.<br /> <br /> If I was writing one I'd probably choose one of the following:<ul><li>Somalia at the hight of piracy.</li> <li>Iraq/Levant at ISIL's peak.</li> <li>New Orleans just after Hurricane Katrina; but not the real New Orleans, the New Orleans from hyperbolic and hysterical news reporting. Full of roving armed gangs, looters, and cannibalism. It would basically be a zombie apocalypse without (ok, maybe with) the zombies. Especially the part where the real danger is other humans or conflict within in your own band of survivors.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 11-25-2016, 02:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-25T15:54:11-08:00","id":1008303,"title":"","content":"Fair enough. I was just wondering, I don't have the time to write it out but I had an idea for a cult warfare and ancient secrets type setting based in the islands and coast of Maine, like finding what Admiral Perry brought back from his expedition to the pole.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12243-dreaming-cat","name":"Dreaming Cat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T15:20:28-08:00","id":1014002,"title":"","content":"Does anyone have any ideas for new sanctity ancestral channels. The new system removes attribute-boosting channels, but all the ancestral channels of sanctity are attribute boosting, meaning that vestige has only descendant channels (which cannot be taken without first taking an ancestral channel) meaning that the sanctity vestige is completely unusable with current rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew thought process.<br /> &quot;I have this great idea for a power/splat/merit/etc/&quot;<br /> &quot;I have no idea if this is balanced, useless, or gamebreaking.&quot;<br /> &quot;I'll ask the internet&quot;<br /> &quot;The thread has died.&quot; <img src=\"images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4226-spiderlord","name":"Spiderlord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T19:00:42-08:00","id":1014090,"title":"","content":"Sanctity is purely mental acts of domination isn't it? Maybe we should start there. My problem is that Call of the Depths covers mind control pretty neatly.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Come to think of it would a Fecundity power to strengthen and grow/control plants/animals be a descendent or ancestral channel?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12243,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12243-dreaming-cat","user":"Dreaming Cat","date":". 12-07-2016, 10:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12243-dreaming-cat","name":"Dreaming Cat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-07T23:55:32-08:00","id":1014194,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spiderlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1014002#post1014002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone have any ideas for new sanctity ancestral channels. The new system removes attribute-boosting channels, but all the ancestral channels of sanctity are attribute boosting, meaning that vestige has only descendant channels (which cannot be taken without first taking an ancestral channel) meaning that the sanctity vestige is completely unusable with current rules.</div> </div> </div> </div>What about, I don't know, tabooing certain actions and ideas? Defying the leviathan's will is blasphemous, and can isolate you from those around you, since they all know it's wrong, too -- killing the leviathan's Beloved doesn't just provoke an Integrity check as you consider how sinful thou art, it makes the people around you hate you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5757-calvaryketer","name":"CalvaryKeter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5757_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T10:24:15-08:00","id":1028204,"title":"","content":"I was a big fan of the first Leviathan and I am overjoyed to see it being updated <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> One of the I noticed was that Tranquility in &quot;Systems and advantages&quot; does not seem to match the material in Chapter Three. I was wondering if it was okay to note that in the G Docs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>What do we want? 3rd Edition Sidereals!<br /> When do we want it? In accordance with the dictates of Fate!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/867-jimborg","name":"Jimborg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T08:26:12-08:00","id":1028559,"title":"","content":"I'm glad to see you enjoying the new material. May I ask what exactly is the mismatch you see?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T16:51:17-08:00","id":1028757,"title":"","content":"In <b>Chapter 3 </b>of the alpha, it refers to the <b>12 box</b> system, where you have Tranquility being nommed at opposite ends by the bestial and divine selves. In <b>Systems and Advantages</b>, it refers to tranquility as having <b>two</b> <b>separate</b> <b>10 box</b> meters, <b>Phronesis </b>and <b>Eunoia. </b>This can also be found in the character creation example in Chapter 3, where it is explained that getting a <b>third</b> dot on either side of the track starts inflicting penalties. Contrasted to Systems and Advantages, where it says that penalties don't start showing up until either your <b>Phronesis or</b> <b>Eunoia </b>is at <b>4</b> (the page doesn't give either stats' starting value).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>What do we want? 3rd Edition Sidereals!<br /> When do we want it? In accordance with the dictates of Fate!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/867-jimborg","name":"Jimborg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T10:36:20-08:00","id":1029144,"title":"","content":"Ok, so you're actually looking at an outdated document. Pretty much everything can now be found in the Chapter X documents in the alpha folder, including the correct 12 box Phronesis and Eunoia mechanics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T18:13:55-08:00","id":1029392,"title":"","content"