e":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T05:14:57-07:00","id":1112609,"title":"","content":"Progress is stalled due to a severe lack of writing motivation. But the Alpha is almost finished. The only things that need to be written are the Rift (you could use the 1E stuff as is) and individual powers (Channels/Rituals) and Merits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T06:22:28-07:00","id":1112635,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1112609#post1112609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Progress is stalled due to a severe lack of writing motivation. But the Alpha is almost finished. The only things that need to be written are the Rift (you could use the 1E stuff as is) and individual powers (Channels/Rituals) and Merits.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Rift is (still?) basically the Tribes' Temenos, manifested as an endless ocean with &quot;lower&quot; layers both shrinking and delving deeper into their Psyche (and all if it lashed by the Tempest), correct?<br /> <br /> Accepting submissions for powers/merits?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T07:59:06-07:00","id":1112679,"title":"","content":"Correct (if &quot;by deeper into the psyche&quot; you mean &quot;less individual and more universal things are deeper&quot;). And feel free to post suggestions <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T08:06:15-07:00","id":1112683,"title":"","content":"Hey King. Been awhile. I am going to post a second leviathan cult idea that is either that carnival idea i originally pitched or possibly a mafia family.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T14:35:41-07:00","id":1112924,"title":"","content":"Have fun writing it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-07T22:23:03-07:00","id":1113114,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1112924#post1112924\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have fun writing it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I am thinking about making their master either a Lahamin or a <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bahamatan. Which one is most fitting for a mob family?</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T04:33:46-07:00","id":1113677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1113114#post1113114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am thinking about making their master either a Lahamin or a <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bahamatan. Which one is most fitting for a mob family?</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>I would say Thalassan, personally. It's up to you, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T04:55:23-07:00","id":1113683,"title":"","content":"Yeah. Thalassan for &quot;legitimate businessmen&quot;. Tanninim for ruthless violent gangsters. Lahamin as an outside bet; a syndicate that focuses heavily on corruption and inside men.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T05:28:52-07:00","id":1113693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1113683#post1113683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah. Thalassan for &quot;legitimate businessmen&quot;. Tanninim for ruthless violent gangsters. Lahamin as an outside bet; a syndicate that focuses heavily on corruption and inside men.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree, there.<br /> <br /> While you're here, as an idea for a Sanctity channel, how about something based around 'mesmerising eyes'? As in it starts out with a 'look into my eyes, you can't look away' thing, then escalates to illusions (coughdelusionscough) implanted via eye contact and eventually to being able to 'suck' a person's mind and consciousness into your mindscape via your eyes, with 'fun' consequences for their sanity? Does that sound OK for a Descendent channel? Maybe call it something like Windows To The Soul? That's the best I can come up with for a name.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T06:02:21-07:00","id":1113699,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't put too much focus on specifics of how a leviathan uses a Channel. There's nothing to stop you saying Besieging the Tower of Will works via hypnotic eyes (in fact I think the Lahamin says they typically manifest Sanctity through visual stimuli). With the exception of Call of the Depth (because sirens are way too thematic not to have a singing power) I'm trying to keep Channels flexible in how they manifest. <br /> <br /> I did throw an illusion power into Piercing the Veil of Slumbers though.<br /> <br /> Incidently 3 Descendent and 3 Ancestral Channels per vestige is ideal. So if you have any idea for Ancestral Sanctity Channels I'd be interested.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T07:03:45-07:00","id":1113716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1113699#post1113699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't put too much focus on specifics of how a leviathan uses a Channel. There's nothing to stop you saying Besieging the Tower of Will works via hypnotic eyes (in fact I think the Lahamin says they typically manifest Sanctity through visual stimuli). With the exception of Call of the Depth (because sirens are way too thematic not to have a singing power) I'm trying to keep Channels flexible in how they manifest.<br /> <br /> I did throw an illusion power into Piercing the Veil of Slumbers though.<br /> <br /> Incidently 3 Descendent and 3 Ancestral Channels per vestige is ideal. So if you have any idea for Ancestral Sanctity Channels I'd be interested.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough. It's kinda tricky coming up with Ancestral powers, though. Passives are difficult.<br /> <br /> That said, I do have an idea. Specifically, what do you think of a Channel related to accessing/interacting with the Astral, specifically the Temenos, seeing as the Temenos is the home of the thoughts/experiences of humanity and, after all, should not a god be ever-present in the minds of his followers? That might be more of an Evolution thing, though. Perhaps a Channel which allows the creation of 'sacred spaces' which induce a tendency towards a certain emotion/type of thought but also apply the effects of the Wake, with larger and more potent 'places of power' being able to be created at higher levels? Argh. That's more like Rituals, though.<br /> <br /> I hate to say it, but I kinda feel like the attribute-boosting channels from 1e might work better than 21 different passives, especially seeing as many Vestiges have conceptual overlaps.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T08:49:02-07:00","id":1113753,"title":"","content":"Leviathans and their Beloved are actually barred from the Temenos; the Tribe has it's own Astral.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T09:39:11-07:00","id":1113772,"title":"","content":"Ancestral Channel ideas (to refine later):<br /> <br /> <b>Sanctity</b><br /> Sanctity Passive abilities, what about skill boosters, or Wake modifications?<br /> <br /> Like, (placeholder [Deific Presence]) gives varying bonuses to the Social skills (in a slightly more precise manner than the Wake). +X, X-again, and the like.<br /> Hmm. As Channels increase in power as Depth decreases, to get the highest bonuses you bascially in mind-breaking form already. Not sure how much room there is for a surprisingly persuasive shark-monster.<br /> <br /> The Mental one could be similar, though I can also see being able to &quot;borrow&quot; mental Skills from your Beloved (or even people in your Wake).<br /> <br /> Wake modification one could drop certain chosen Conditions on targets instead of/in addition to the normal Breaking Points (like how the Iron Masters can choose what Lunacy effect happens to mortals while on their Sacred Hunt). Both don't really have any action themselves, merely modifying pre-existing actions.<br /> <br /> <b>Predation</b><br /> For Predation, I see Combat and Weaponry represented. What about hunting/tracking, like a shark with blood in the water?<br /> <br /> <b>Vitality</b><br /> I actually think healing abilities (like The Hydra's Rebirth) fits better under Vitality. But as for other options... Wake about various methods of boosting supernatural resistance? Lifeblood of Titans for physical armor, and this for supernatural attacks?<br /> <br /> <b>Fecundity</b><br /> ...I got nothing so far. Anything I can think of falls better under Descendant Channels or Rituals. Charm/Seduction like effects? Probably fits better under Sanctity.<br /> <br /> <b>Elements</b><br /> Maybe resistance to other environmental conditions (like temperature, etc.)? Since actually influencing the elements seems reserved for Descendant Channels and Rituals.<br /> <br /> <b>Awareness</b><br /> Lambent Eyes of Judgement seems to include most related thematic abilities. I can think of other &quot;detection&quot; powers, flavored through the lens of other Vestiges, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 07-09-2017, 01:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T18:42:17-07:00","id":1113974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1113753#post1113753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Leviathans and their Beloved are actually barred from the Temenos; the Tribe has it's own Astral.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait... So no Dragon crossover? :'&lt;<br /> This makes me a sad Raccoon...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/873174-dragon-rekindled-the-orobori-chronicles-embers-reboot#post873174\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Dragon Rekindled: The Oroboroi Chronicles.</b></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#696969\">The official reboot of <b>Dragon: The Embers</b>.</span></span></span></a>","edited":{"userid":10120,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10120-rockstarraccoon","user":"RockstarRaccoon","date":". 07-09-2017, 09:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10120-rockstarraccoon","name":"RockstarRaccoon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10120_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T19:49:11-07:00","id":1114003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RockstarRaccoon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1113974#post1113974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait... So no Dragon crossover? :'&lt;<br /> This makes me a sad Raccoon...</div> </div> </div> </div>Nonsense. That just means each can go &quot;WTF are you?&quot; when encountering each other.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T22:09:28-07:00","id":1114057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RockstarRaccoon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1113974#post1113974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait... So no Dragon crossover? :'&lt;<br /> This makes me a sad Raccoon...</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, that just means that there's another, scarier, wronger place for Dragons to somehow end up in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T22:20:30-07:00","id":1114058,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RockstarRaccoon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1113974#post1113974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait... So no Dragon crossover? :'&lt;<br /> This makes me a sad Raccoon...</div> </div> </div> </div>Only humans, mages and beasts have access to the Temenos anyway. The former two counting as humans, and the latter being born from the Temenos.<br /> I haven't read why Leviathans are explicitly barred from the Temenos, but it's to be expected that they can't normally enter since that's how it is for the majority of all supernaturals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T22:21:17-07:00","id":1114059,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114057#post1114057\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nah, that just means that there's another, scarier, wronger place for Dragons to somehow end up in.</div> </div> </div> </div>There always is. And as always, the hearts eventually make their way back for another story to tell. Another Legend to make.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T02:04:18-07:00","id":1114090,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114003#post1114003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nonsense. That just means each can go &quot;WTF are you?&quot; when encountering each other.</div> </div> </div> </div> Leviathans are fully aware of what the Temenos is, they have an innate ability to see astral entities and some powerful abilities to muck around with dreams.<br /> <br /> They might have no personal connection to humanity's mindscape, but they're perfectly capable of screwing with it. Leviathans are psychic/divine after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T05:39:30-07:00","id":1114120,"title":"","content":"So, here's a couple of ideas for Channels, one Ancestral. <br /> <br /> <b>Ever-Coiling Oroborus (Descendant Awareness)</b><br /> <i>In the Primordial Waters, all things were as one. There was no </i><i>past, no future, no might-have-been or never-was. The leviathan who masters this Channels harkens back to that primordial oneness, experiencing alternate selves as merely facets of the same being.</i><br /> <br /> Ever-Coiling Oroboros allows a leviathan to effectively take several actions at a time and pick and choose which he wants to happen, collapsing the other 'reality wave-forms' into his chosen one. The greater the Depth, the longer the action can take (Reflexive at Depth 2, Instant at Depth 4, several turns at Depth 6 and Extended at Depth 7, for example) and the more 'alternates' the Leviathan can create. <br /> <br /> <b>Manifold Tyrant-Mind (Ancestral Sanctity)</b><br /> <i>To a god, all beneath him are his property, and property should be defended. Therefore it is only right that the Leviathan possess an unparalleled grasp of strategy to counter any who might attempt to steal what is his.</i><br /> <br /> Manifold Tyrant-Mind is a Channel based around two things: multitasking, to a near-infinite level in the greater Depths, and the brute-forcing of strategic genius (represented via bonuses, X-agains and so on) by having dozens of parallel minds simulating potential situations. Emphasis on 'strategy', as the simulations are not precognition and are almost solely focused on planning. Of course, no plan survives contact with the enemy (or insane culstists, the leviathan's own ego etc).<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T05:44:44-07:00","id":1114121,"title":"","content":"Also, with the Vestiges, I wanted to check that I'm getting the conceptual purviews right:<br /> <br /> <b>Awareness</b><br /> Knowledge, senses, prophecy, mind-reading.<br /> <br /> <b>Elements</b><br /> Control of the world beyond the leviathan itself, with an emphasis on darkness, water and earth, as well as large-scale, ill-controlled stuff.<br /> <br /> <b>Fecundity</b><br /> Creation, birth, evolution, gifting, plenty, symbiosis.<br /> <br /> <b>Might</b><br /> Strength and raw power.<br /> <br /> <b>Predation</b><br /> Cunning, hunting abilities and natural weapons. Venom more than poison.<br /> <br /> <b>Sanctity</b><br /> Mental control, domination and matery of people, as well as a certain degree of protection for those under the proverbial wings.<br /> <br /> <b>Vitality</b><br /> Defenses, armour, healing, poison.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T12:12:39-07:00","id":1114232,"title":"","content":"What about the Anima Mundi? I can't remember myself but are Leviathans banned from it as well? Also, was it ever established what happens if a Leviathan brute-forces its way into the Tenemos? Sorry in advance if I'm being repetitive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12243-dreaming-cat","name":"Dreaming Cat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T14:41:38-07:00","id":1114284,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dreaming Cat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114232#post1114232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about the Anima Mundi? I can't remember myself but are Leviathans banned from it as well? Also, was it ever established what happens if a Leviathan brute-forces its way into the Tenemos? Sorry in advance if I'm being repetitive.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unless Leviathans are simply not part of this world, I would think the Rift reaches down to the Anima Mundi. There are irises to the Anima Mundi in the deep Shadow, so Spirits, which are so inhuman they may not <i>have</i> a Temenos-equivalent can get there (unless you consider the Shadow or the Spirit Marches to be the spirit's &quot;astral&quot;). I don't see why Leviathans would be disconnected from the World Soul.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T18:03:45-07:00","id":1114330,"title":"","content":"New Leviathain Cult<br /> <br /> The Marino Family<br /> <br /> When one of thinks of brutal mob families one pops into their head, The Marinos. Founded by Bruno Marino in 1938, this family has been the terror of the San Diego underworld for having the reputation of killing, maiming, and disfiguring anyone who posses a threat to their operations. However, they save the worse of these punishments for traitors to the family and those that violate the code of Omerta. They have been known to burn traitors alive, disembowel them and other horrific punishments as a way to discourage future treachery. This brutality comes from the god they worship, a Tanninim that overlooks the fact that they are gangsters.<br /> <br /> <br /> It is unknown how the gangsters got affected by the Wake and when. What is know however is the fact that the Marinos seem to be incredibly zealous and loyal to their Leviathan. Another unusual aspect to other Leviathans is the fact they none of the other Leviathans have ever seen him or her. The Marino's god seems to keep to itself most of the time and only surfaces to give it's Beloved orders. Mobsters who are questioned about this god refuse to talk about it, saying that it would severely punish them if they did. The Marino's human leader is Big Al Marino, a corpulent mobster of about 45 and seems to be the Leviathian;s mouthpiece for the cult. Big Al is almost as elusive as the god he worships, trying his hardest to stay out of the public spotlight to avoid arrest. Marino and his thugs thrive to continue their existence while the Wake continues to erode their sanity while the Leviathain struggles to keep the brutal gangsters from doing something horrifically stupid.<br /> <br /> Fervor: 4<br /> Piety: 4<br /> Zeal: 1<br /> <br /> What do you guys think of this cult?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T21:14:27-07:00","id":1114402,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114284#post1114284\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Unless Leviathans are simply not part of this world, I would think the Rift reaches down to the Anima Mundi. There are irises to the Anima Mundi in the deep Shadow, so Spirits, which are so inhuman they may not <i>have</i> a Temenos-equivalent can get there (unless you consider the Shadow or the Spirit Marches to be the spirit's &quot;astral&quot;). I don't see why Leviathans would be disconnected from the World Soul.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough it's simply that, unless I am mistaken, Leviathan has a theme in that <i>you do not belong</i>. The world has moved on from the Primordial days and you are the vestigial fin. But honestly it seems to be ST caveat either way.<br /> <br /> On the Marino Family I wonder if Piety represents mimicking normal behavior or acceptable behavior. Seems good though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12243-dreaming-cat","name":"Dreaming Cat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-10T21:25:57-07:00","id":1114410,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dreaming Cat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114402#post1114402\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fair enough it's simply that, unless I am mistaken, Leviathan has a theme in that <i>you do not belong</i>. The world has moved on from the Primordial days and you are the vestigial fin. But honestly it seems to be ST caveat either way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, you're stil a part of the &quot;world&quot; so to speak. You're just a primitive, unnecessary, irrelevant part. Thus, the Leviathans branch off in the Astral long before Humanity arises. Beasts, to compare, are a manifestation of a specifically human part of the world's consciousness, but they're not human. As a result, they can access the human gestalt of the Temenos, and are plugged into the universal gestalt of the Anima Mundi, but they don't have Oneiroi like mortals and Mages.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T04:15:04-07:00","id":1114515,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114120#post1114120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Ever-Coiling Oroborus (Descendant Awareness)</b></div> </div> </div> </div> Parallel realities sounds interesting, but it's quite close to the existing time travel stuff and there's less material in other gamelines to build on.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114120#post1114120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Manifold Tyrant-Mind (Ancestral Sanctity)</b></div> </div> </div> </div> Strategy powers sounds good, but bonuses and x agains are fairly boring. If you could think of specific unique abilities that would be better.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114121#post1114121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Might</b><br /> Strength and raw power.</div> </div> </div> </div> Also grace could fit here too, and raw power in a more metaphorical sense. I was thinking that if Leviathans have a counter magic power it would work much like Princesses' they'd physically rip magic apart with their hands (or telekenesis)<br /> <br /> <b>Vitality</b>Defenses, armour, healing, poison.[/QUOTE] And any self-body control that doesn't fit elsewhere.<br /> <br /> The others are correct.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dreaming Cat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114232#post1114232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, was it ever established what happens if a Leviathan brute-forces its way into the Tenemos?</div> </div> </div> </div> Depending on their power level they could start spreading madness and chaos on a global scale. Their wake would spread to all humans thinking about whatever part of the Tenemos they're in.<br /> <br /> But remember that in the cosmic sense Leviathan's are small fry. They're demigods, terifying to a supernaural being, and powerless before a real god. If every human who starts thinking of water was being battered by the wake something will step in before too long.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dreaming Cat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114232#post1114232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about the Anima Mundi? I can't remember myself but are Leviathans banned from it as well?</div> </div> </div> </div> The Tribe cannot reach the Anima Mundi symbolising their alienness to the world. Nobody's gone below the bottom of the rift and come back to tell of it; though some Leviathans think that's because they're too happy to come back, and you always get the School of the Sun thinking they just need a bigger cult and a better ritual than the last guy to try.<br /> <br /> If they forced themselves into the Anima Mundi nothing special will happen. The Tribe might be alien to the world, but they are here. Symbolically they'd be moving from part of the world to part of the world. No change. The natives probably wouldn't like them though.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T06:20:12-07:00","id":1114555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114515#post1114515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Parallel realities sounds interesting, but it's quite close to the existing time travel stuff and there's less material in other gamelines to build on.</div> </div> </div> </div>The idea was that the power relies upon something like the idea of 'choice-based reality', where every choice spawns a different reality. The Channel is simply the ability to perceive multiple possibilities at once and then to pick and choose which result you want to actually happen. Say you use it to spawn two alternate timelines (for three total), one in which you run away from a fight, one in which you try to talk them down and one in which you go all Biblical on their asses. You could see how those play out, for the time you've got those timelines running at elast, and then choose which one you want to 'collapse' into when time runs out.<br /> <br /> I'd probably make it so that making a new 'split' costs 1 Ichor + 1 more for each split already active, make it pricey to overuse it. A player could really game that power into some very useful stuff if they wanted to. On the other hand, it could be a real headache for Storytellers. You'd effectively have to manage a whole set of events at once.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114515#post1114515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Strategy powers sounds good, but bonuses and x agains are fairly boring. If you could think of specific unique abilities that would be better.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can definitelt see what you mean. I'll have a go at getting something more complete. Just as a thought, what do you think of the Channel having a tendency to create forms with multiple head/several mouths etc?<br /> <br /> Note that this Channel does not conjure information from nowhere (e.g. it cannot tell the user that their opponent seeks the Lost Tablet of Elish if the user does not know that the tablet exists, although it might infer that they are seeking a powerful Heirloom).<ul><li><b>Depth 1: </b>Birthright of Sanctity</li> <li><b>Depth 2:</b> The leviathan gains the ability to run two simultanous trains of thought, allowing them to take two mental actions at a given time. They could, for instance, read a book while simultaneously solving a complex piece of arithmetic. She could not read two books at once, though, as her eyes cannot lookat both at once - probably, at least.</li> <li><b>Depth 3:</b> The leviathan becomes able to create three separate trains of thought at once. She can also use all three together to anticipate the actions of an opponent in a chorus of half-prophecy, half-simulation. Roll Intelligence + Empathy as an Extended action, each interval equal to (11-Sheol) minutes, a maximum number of Intervals equal to the Leviathan's current number of Ichor and a target of the opponent's Manipulation (or Finesse) + Supernatural Attribute. Penalties or bonuses apply based on how much information the leviathan has on their opponent. Attempting to anticipate an old friend might net a +3 bonus, while attempting to predict the actions of a leviathan only known through vague rumours might suffer a penalty of -5. On a success, the leviathan may ask a number of questions of the Storyteller equal to (Sheol/2 rounded up) which must answered truthfully, if not completely.. For the purposes of this Channel, an 'opponent' must be a being of some kind. Spells, gods and other such phenomena are beyond its purview.<ul><li>What does my opponent want?</li> <li>Why is my opponent doing what they are doing?</li> <li>What resistance am I likely to face if I do X?</li> <li>What is my opponent?</li> <li>What resources does my opponent have access to?</li> <li>What will my opponent most likely do next?</li> </ul></li> <li><b>Depth 4:</b> The leviathan may create four separate trains of thought, and gains 9-again on all Empathy or Persuasion rolls.</li> <li><b>Depth 5:</b> The leviathan may create five contiguous trains of thought. In addition, their leviathan predictive abilties are magnified to the point that they can make quick-fire predictions in battle, rolling Intelligence + Empathy + Sheol vs the opponent's Manipulation + Supernatural Advantage as an Instant action. He may ask a number of question from the above list equal to his successes, although the answers are typically lesser in scope. Tactics, not strategy.</li> <li><b>Depth 6: </b>The leviathan may create six simultaneous trains of thought. On contested rolls using Mental or Social Attributes, unless the opponent is using some form of magic to boost their mind or is using an Attribute with a score greater than the leviathan's Intelligence, they lose 10-again as they find themselves outthought at every turn.</li> <li><b>Depth 7:</b> I'd like to have something here about being able to formulate a full-on Xanatos Gambit (see here: <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/XanatosGambit\" target=\"_blank\">http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.ph.../XanatosGambit</a>) but I'm not sure how to represent that mechanically.</li> </ul><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114515#post1114515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Also grace could fit here too, and raw power in a more metaphorical sense. I was thinking that if Leviathans have a counter magic power it would work much like Princesses' they'd physically rip magic apart with their hands (or telekenesis)</div> </div> </div> </div>That.... sounds really cool, actually. How does <b>Irresistible Hex-Rending Talons</b>sound? (I'll admit that I tapped into my inner Solar Exalt for that bit. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114515#post1114515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> And any self-body control that doesn't fit elsewhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm. This is like that <b>No Mysteries of the Flesh </b>Channel from 1e, yes?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T10:57:08-07:00","id":1114671,"title":"","content":"Can you use the separate mental action as Teamwork rolls?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T11:01:01-07:00","id":1114672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114671#post1114671\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can you use the separate mental action as Teamwork rolls?</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you mean teamwork with yourself? I like that idea, conceptually, although I can't remember the Teamwork rules off the top of my head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T11:18:38-07:00","id":1114682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114672#post1114672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you mean teamwork with yourself? I like that idea, conceptually, although I can't remember the Teamwork rules off the top of my head.</div> </div> </div> </div>If I recall, 2ndary actors roll their dice pool, and successes are added to the Primary actor's pool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T11:45:07-07:00","id":1114692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114682#post1114682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If I recall, 2ndary actors roll their dice pool, and successes are added to the Primary actor's pool.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm. Perhaps that could be an ability unlocked at Depth 4, because lower than that the 'thought-structures' are too similar for the leviathan to actually make use of in self-teamwork actions?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T12:36:11-07:00","id":1114706,"title":"","content":"Hey King, if it is okay with you i might write a piece of fiction on the Marinos whacking a traitor to the family and a Marduk agent who was meeting with the traitor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-15T15:15:43-07:00","id":1116574,"title":"","content":"Has anyone got any ideas for Ancestral Fecundity? I think that Lord of the Seas could probably be re-done with comparative ease, but I don't know about the other two. Perhaps Hydra's Rebirth could be made Ancestral, and we separate the old Everflowing Fetid Growth into two Channels, one for plant control and one for ichor-based augmentation?<br /> <br /> As the ideas of symbiosis and 'self-contained ecologies' are quite central to Fecundity and the Dagonites, perhaps something could be done with that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-21T10:59:41-07:00","id":1119037,"title":"","content":"Was reading the Marduk doc. Is there any place for a piece of tech that let's the Marduk agent use things like Abjuration, Warding, and the like against Leviathans and/or their powers? Like electrified Faraday cages that resist Rituals, or a field emitter that forces Hybrids to flee or face Ichor loss?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-21T13:35:21-07:00","id":1119063,"title":"","content":"Probably. But not in the corebook; such things belong in a crossover chapter.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114555#post1114555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The idea was that the power relies upon something like the idea of 'choice-based reality', where every choice spawns a different reality.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like I said, stuff like that is usually folded into Time by the WoD.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114555#post1114555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Just as a thought, what do you think of the Channel having a tendency to create forms with multiple head/several mouths etc?</div> </div> </div> </div> A channel that could be expressed through multiple heads is fine; a channel that requires you to have multiple heads is not. I try to be as flexible as possible about how channels work (is Besieging the Power of Will pure brain to brain telepathy of glowing swirly hypnotic eyes?). Call of the Depths is probably the only exception, but singing is strongly associated with merfolk.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Channel you proposed feels closer to Awareness than Sanctity. For a strategy Sanctity power I'd lean more towards a &quot;subconcious telepathic mission control&quot;. For a multi-thought Awareness channel perhaps something like.<br /> <br /> <br /> <u><b>Panoptic Tyrant</b></u><ul><li><b>Depth 1: </b>Birthright of Awareness</li> <li><b>Depth 2:</b> The leviathan gains the ability to run two simultanous trains of thought, allowing them to take two mental actions at a given time. They could, for instance, read a book while simultaneously solving a complex piece of arithmetic. She could not read two books at once, though, as her eyes cannot look at both at once - probably, at least.</li> <li><b>Depth 3:</b> The leviathan may take in a wholistic picture of their suroundings and analyise it. They must spend a full turn and roll Perception. On a Success they may ask one of the following questions. Every two further successes grants another question:<ul><li>Is there anyone here I do not expect to be here?</li> <li>Are my servants where I expect them to be?</li> <li>Is there an unexpected source of danger here?</li> <li>Is there anything noticably out of place here?</li> <li>What avalable escape routes are there (including escape into the Rift)?</li> </ul></li> <li><b>Depth 4:</b> The leviathan's natural senses grow so varied and precise that they exceed natural laws. Whenever a supernatural power makes the distinction between natural and supernatural senses the leviathan's basic perception counts as whichever would be more advantagious. The leviathan can also see wheather something is supernatural or not supernatural, however identifying what kind of supernatural phenomina they are looking at requires occult lore and experience. Supernatural defences can block the leviathan's sight.</li> <li><b>Depth 5:</b> When using the Depth 3 itteration of this channel the following additional questions become availble:<ul><li>Is there anything supernatural here?</li> <li>?</li> <li>?</li> </ul></li> <li><b>Depth 6: </b> The leviathan is constantly subconciously gathering and processing information, their mind is filled with useful information that they do not even know that they know. Once per session they may use the Depth 5 itteration of this channel reflexively.</li> <li><b>Depth 7:</b> So long as the Leviathan is in a place (or perceving a place) they know intamately they apply the Rote Action rule to all Perception rolls. Their finely tuned mind and senses detect the slightest change with contemptable ease.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1114555#post1114555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That.... sounds really cool, actually. How does <b>Irresistible Hex-Rending Talons</b>sound? (I'll admit that I tapped into my inner Solar Exalt for that bit. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )</div> </div> </div> </div> Sure. Why not.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T08:45:16-07:00","id":1125608,"title":"","content":"It's <b>very</b> late, I know, but here's the first usable version I've got of the character sheet for Leviathan. I apologise for the lack of 'transformation' section, but I wasn't sure how I'd set it up. Also, the little squares were a pain in the ass, and they still look unpleasantly irregular.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9KaEz_D7phwVVZrNWZUX3hCaG8/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9KaEz_D7phwVVZrNWZUX3hCaG8/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9KaEz_D7phwVVZrNWZUX3hCaG8/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B9KaEz_D7phwVVZrNWZUX3hCaG8/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedat