arget=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-07T12:53:41-07:00","id":1126000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1125979#post1125979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly. I have no idea how you'd do Depths. There's so many things it affects.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll probably take <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7212_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7212\" data-vbnamecard=\"7212\">Vent0</a> 's suggestions, then, and leave an area in each Depth for notes on changes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-08T03:20:59-07:00","id":1126239,"title":"","content":"Well, here's the fixed character sheet and the Depths sheet. I did it as a separate thing due to... formatting issues (damn Word).<br /> <br /> Anyway:<br /> <br /> <b>Leviathan 2-page character sheet</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B9KaEz_D7phwTl84OHdtbEtkSTg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B9KaEz_D7phwTl84OHdtbEtkSTg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B9KaEz_D7phwTl84OHdtbEtkSTg\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B9KaEz_D7phwTl84OHdtbEtkSTg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Depths sheet</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B9KaEz_D7phwTUxzV3QxSlF0eHc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B9KaEz_D7phwTUxzV3QxSlF0eHc\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B9KaEz_D7phwTUxzV3QxSlF0eHc\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B9KaEz_D7phwTUxzV3QxSlF0eHc </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> If these meet with your approval, is there some way I could send them to you properly to put in the central Leviathan folder?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-08T04:06:41-07:00","id":1126250,"title":"","content":"Had the stub of an idea for a Fecundity Ancestral Channel based on playing around with Maturation and Age. Issue is how to turn that into 6 powers. Some degree fast healing might work, but that is pretty close to The Hydra's Rebirth (even if it isn't full Turn to Turn regeneration).<br /> <br /> Ideas (subject to change)<br /> 1. Birthright if Fecundity<br /> 2. Adjust aging/maturation rate. <br /> 3. Reduce target's healing rate by 50%. And/or immune to disease (anti-Fecundity applied to microbes)<br /> 4. Boost healing rate by 50%.<br /> 5. Can suspend aging.<br /> 6. Can supercharge aging.<br /> 7.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 08-08-2017, 10:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-30T12:48:06-07:00","id":1154190,"title":"","content":"Would any degree of Item Manipulation be suitable for any of the Channels? I know they are largely Biological or Psychic focused, but something to ground &quot;magic/holy item creation&quot; Rituals around might be nice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-14T04:42:17-08:00","id":1167571,"title":"","content":"A thought building off of <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7212_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7212\" data-vbnamecard=\"7212\">Vent0</a> 's idea for an item-manipulation Channel and one for a 'ZOMBIES!' Fecundity Channel, could we perhaps draw some ideas from Revlid's Metagaos charms for Exalted? Specifically, the ones branching off from Greedy Gawping Grip and Self-Seed Infestation.<br /> <br /> The former could probably be an Ancestral Channel allowing a Leviathan to incorporate items (although not, of course, complex technology) into themselves, and give themselves bonuses to using those incorporated items. The latter would almost certainly be Descendent, and would allow the Leviathan to act as a cauldron of disease and contagion, eventually creating a 'flesh-zombie virus', albeit one restricted to the scope of the Leviathan's wake by the arcane physics it requires to exist.<br /> <br /> Here is the link to the charmset: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nsYGnXacHopk93slHd_PIhdgnq0Lti4HnPEowfOVXp0/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...owfOVXp0/edit#</a><br /> <br /> EDIT: And to the extra charms: \u200b<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1l7aryEjl63GJ9D5ZJ1PPA-Uwu5HG-Tp6VxODtBwgmYE/edit\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...ODtBwgmYE/edit</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 12-14-2017, 08:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-20T12:59:21-08:00","id":1169179,"title":"","content":"Would it be out of the question to have an Ancestral Fecundity Channel whereby the Leviathan can mutate useful shapes spontaneously, allowing it to basically gain tool bonuses in a way similar to the old Magnanimous Host to All? It would probably be more focused on allowing the Leviathan to do things which it usually couldn't rather than just giving numerical bonuses, like turning fingertips into scalpels. Maybe there could be an Adaptation which allows it to separate off those mutations (possibly requiring Womb of terrors as well?) as biological equipment?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 12-20-2017, 04:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-22T10:34:16-08:00","id":1169678,"title":"","content":"I'm trying to avoid giving Leviathans any powers that relate to modenity like tool use.<br /> <br /> Anyway I'll see if I can get the charachter sheets into the drive for you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> a Leviathan becoming toxic would probably fall under Vitality like The Toad's Curse from 1E. But there's no reason why a few Adaptations cannot result in wide spread Toxins","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-22T11:53:52-08:00","id":1169693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1169678#post1169678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm trying to avoid giving Leviathans any powers that relate to modenity like tool use.</div> </div> </div> </div>How modern are we talking here? Tool use predates the general Bronze-Age feel of Leviathans. Heck, other <i>animals</i> use tools.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1169678#post1169678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyway I'll see if I can get the charachter sheets into the drive for you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> a Leviathan becoming toxic would probably fall under Vitality like The Toad's Curse from 1E. But there's no reason why a few Adaptations cannot result in wide spread Toxins</div> </div> </div> </div>What about a Parasitism-based Zombies Fecundity power? &quot;Go, my tiny reanimator spawn! Puppet their husks for the glory of your Parent/God!&quot;<br /> <hr /><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar134_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"134\" data-vbnamecard=\"134\">The Kings Raven</a> what are the Vestiges as they currently stand. if you could give a summary? Last time I looked, many Channels were missing entries. Still trying for 3 Ancestral, 3 Descendant?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 12-22-2017, 02:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-22T12:34:47-08:00","id":1169703,"title":"","content":"Talking of unnatural life, I found another set of Charms which would probably work very well for Fecundity: those of the Great Mother Kimbery. I've got a document here: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=188Qm-wkrM7I9wCvfrT95Z3QuL_NNBiONZ6f7bih4hDk\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=188...iONZ6f7bih4hDk</a><br /> <br /> Really, Kimbery's Charms as a whole work really well for Leviathan, seeing as she shares a lot of their associations - water, parenthood, being really a really shitty parent, fecundity and so on. Could the charm-set based off of Great Mother's Wame be adapted as a Fecundity Channel? I think that one problem with Mother of a Thousand Young as it stands is that it's trying to do too much at once via all of its Adaptations. I propose that we keep MoaTY as a short-term, in-combat Fecundity channel and add a second one for longer-term creatures, with Incubation of the Second Self being based off of the latter. That way we could organize Fecundity as a whole along these lines:<br /> <br /> <b>Ancestral</b><br /> - Plant empathy/abilities (photosynthesis etc)<br /> - Animal empathy/commands (ala Lord of the Sea)<br /> - &quot;I am an ecosystem unto myself&quot;-type Channel (possibly allowing increasing one skill at the cost of another by having one part of they body-ecosystem devour another and breed more of itself?)<br /> <br /> <b>Descendant</b><br /> - Mother of a Thousand Young<br /> - Hydra's Rebirth<br /> - Permanent Biological Construct Channel<br /> <br /> Another option would be to shift Hydra's Rebirth into Vitality (TBH I kinda think it ought to have been there in the beginning; regeneration and armour kind of go together) and shifting the &quot;Ecosystem unto myself&quot; channel into Descendent Fecundity. Maybe the plant zombies could be an Adaptation of the ecosystem Channel along with the permanent biological construct Channel?<br /> <br /> <br /> And finally, I've got a possible Ancestral Awareness Channel in the works as well. It's kind of a combination psychic/electrical sense, with the latter being based off of what sharks can do. A 'sight beyond sight'-type thing. I'll post it once I've got it in a reasonable state.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-23T02:53:13-08:00","id":1169865,"title":"","content":"Here's that Awareness Channel I was talking about. It's quite crude for now and I really don't know if it's too powerful or too weak.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <u><b>Sight Beyond Sight (Ancestral Channel)</b></u><br /> <i>It is a human thing to equate sight with perception. The leviathan has rediscovered other ways of understanding the world.</i><br /> <br /> The leviathan possesses senses beyond the traditional five of humanity.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 1:</b> Birthright of Awareness<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 2:</b> The leviathan can notice astral entities, projecting psychics or the use of psychic powers within their Wake as a niggling feeling of 'pressure' in the rough direction of the activity, although this feeling is nebulous and non-specific. Everything feels more or less the same, save for other leviathans' Wakes and the Sigils of Marduk. Atolls are invisible to the leviathan's senses, even when actively using psychic powers.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 3:</b> The leviathan gains an ability similar to that of a shark to sense the presence of the Wicked Tribe's ancient bane: electricity. The leviathan can concentrate and roll Sheol + Science as an Instant action to sense any current electricity within (Sheol*5) yards. Within (Sheol) yards the leviathan is capable of sensing the minute electrical impulses released by the movement of muscles, rolling Sheol + Medicine. Those attempting to hide from the leviathan can do so by remaining utterly still.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 4:</b> The leviathan's psychic sense improves, allowing him to roll Sheol + Occult as an Instant action to locate psychic activity within his Wake. This allows the leviathan to ask one of the following questions per success:<ul><li>How far away is the psychic phenomenon?</li> <li>What kind of psychic power is being used?*</li> <li>In what direction is the psychic phenomenon?</li> <li>Is the psychic phenomenon the result of a human?</li> <li>How powerful is the psychic phenomenon?**</li> </ul>*This provides broad answers such as 'telepathy' or 'pyrokinesis'.<br /> <br /> **This power provides either an assessment of an astral entity's Rank or the rating of the psychic Merit being used.<br /> <br /> Furthermore, the leviathan's electrical sense is improved. They no longer need to concentrate to sense electrical current, rolling as a Reflexive action and can sense muscle activity within (Sheol*5) yards.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 5: </b>The leviathan no longer needs to concentrate to locate psychic phenomena within its Wake, allowing her to roll Sheol + Occult as a Reflexive action. Add the following questions to the list of those which the leviathan may ask:<ul><li>In which direction is the nearest individual with a psychic ability?</li> <li>How far is the nearest individual with a psychic ability?</li> </ul>Some leviathans use this power to locate potentially useful individuals to approach. Others simply do their best to make such psychics Beloved and add them to their Cult<br /> <br /> The leviathan's sense for electricity extends its range, sensing electrical current at (Sheol*10) yards. Their sense for muscle activity becomes finer, allowing the leviathan to concentrate as an Instant action and roll Sheol + Medicine to guess at roughly what the individual is doing.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 6:</b> The Leviathan's psychic senses pierce the souls and minds of those he analyses, allowing him to identify greater details of the mental abilities of others. Add the following questions to the list of those that may be asked with a successful Sheol + Occult roll:<ul><li>How many psychic powers does this person possess?</li> <li>What psychic power does this person use most?</li> <li>What is this person's most powerful psychic ability?</li> <li>What is this person's least powerful psychic ability?</li> </ul>The leviathan need no longer concentrate to identify what another is doing via their muscle activity, rolling Sheol + Medicine as a Reflexive action.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 7:</b> The primordial waters run deep, and to the things that lurk there the subtle fire of the psychic mind is nothing but a beacon, vulnerable by virtue of its openness. When the leviathan focuses the Wake upon a psychic being, human, Lahmasu or astral, he opens a number of doors equal to his Sheol, as opposed to half.<br /> <br /> The leviathan's electrical sense extends to cover the entirety of his Wake, both for current electricity and for muscle activity.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-23T04:57:27-08:00","id":1169885,"title":"","content":"Nice. I might give 