<br /> --<br /> <b>Descendant</b><br /> --<br /> --<br /> --<br /> <br /> <u><b>Might</b></u><br /> <b>Ancestral</b><br /> (?Irresistible Hex-Rending Talons)<br /> --<br /> --<br /> <b>Descendant</b><br /> --<br /> --<br /> -- <hr /><br /> Looks like a lot left to fill.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 12-23-2017, 05:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-23T15:08:44-08:00","id":1170032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170007#post1170007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sure. <hr /><br /> So, the current loadout looks like:<br /> <br /> <u><b>Awareness</b></u><br /> <b>Ancestral</b><br /> Lambent Eyes of Judgement<br /> (Sight Beyond Sight)<br /> (Panoptic Tyrant)<br /> <b>Descendant</b><br /> The Key and the Gate<br /> Eye of the Watchful Deity<br /> --<br /> <br /> <u><b>Elements</b></u><br /> <b>Ancestral</b><br /> Uncrowned Fisher King<br /> --<br /> --<br /> <b>Descendant</b><br /> Echo of the Deluge<br /> Swallowing the Sun<br /> Unchained Heart of the World<br /> <br /> <u><b>Fecundity</b></u><br /> <b>Ancestral</b><br /> --<br /> --<br /> --<br /> <b>Descendant</b><br /> The Hydra's Rebirth<br /> Mother of a Thousand Young<br /> --<br /> <br /> <u><b>Predation</b></u><br /> <b>Ancestral</b><br /> King Atop a Bloody Throne<br /> Mortal Devouring Armory<br /> --<br /> <b>Descendant</b><br /> Breath of Burning Lamps<br /> --<br /> --<br /> <br /> <u><b>Sanctity</b></u><br /> <b>Ancestral</b><br /> --<br /> --<br /> --<br /> <b>Descendant</b><br /> Call of the Depths<br /> Besieging the Tower of Will<br /> Piercing the Veil of Slumber<br /> <br /> <u><b>Vitality</b></u><br /> <b>Ancestral</b><br /> Flesh of the Progenitors<br /> --<br /> --<br /> <b>Descendant</b><br /> --<br /> --<br /> --<br /> <br /> <u><b>Might</b></u><br /> <b>Ancestral</b><br /> (?Irresistible Hex-Rending Talons)<br /> --<br /> --<br /> <b>Descendant</b><br /> --<br /> --<br /> -- <hr /><br /> Looks like a lot left to fill.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's the middle of the night here, but I'll see what I can do about supplying ideas to fill those gaps in the morning. If nothing else, I'm good at brainstorming.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T01:17:40-08:00","id":1170120,"title":"","content":"<u><b>Awareness</b></u><br /> <br /> Well, we've only got one Descendant Channel left to do here, and it seems to me that about the only thing we're missing in Awareness is some kind of prophetic ability. Now, prophecy is always tricky to do in an RPG, so perhaps we could work with that to make something a little unique as prophetic powers go. What if, instead of having the Leviathan be a 'future-seer', they are a speaker of self-fulfilling prophecies - part prediction and part memetic instrument of will. In essence what I'm proposing is that the Leviathan's prophecy, by virtue of being spoken, increases the odds of a specific future happening partly by giving dice to those furthering it and partly by serving as a statement to the Storyteller of what the player wants, allowing them to work that into the story or present obstacles to it as necessary. The 'weight' a Leviathan can put behind their future increases with increasing Depth.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Elements</b></u><br /> <br /> Hmm. Well, passive Elements powers are tricky, but I have a couple of ideas. I did always like the old <i> Rain-Dance of the Tempest</i> Channel, so some kind of space-warping Channel based off of non-euclidean geometry seems like a good one, and fitting for Leviathan's themes. As for the other, what about a Channel that allows a degree of control over Resonance and Essence within the Wake? Leviathans predate most divisions, including presumably that between the flesh and the spirit. We could crib some powers from the Idigam's Essence-Shaping abilities. My only issue with that is that the power might be a too powerful to be a passive one, and it might be better as a Descendant Channel, which doesn't really help. Perhaps some kind of natural EMP/tech-disruption aura?<br /> <br /> <u><b>Fecundity</b></u><br /> <br /> I've already proposed ideas for Fecundity above. With reference to the 'permanent minions' Channel idea, though, I did re-think it a little, and I'm proposing that we base it, again, off of the Idigam's Essence-Shaping abilities, albeit with a more fleshy 'spin'.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Predation</b></u><br /> <br /> I propose a stealth-booster, escalating to effective invisibility, as per the old <i>Stalker's Shifting Hide. </i>It was a good one. That said, it might be better to shift that up to Descendant and maybe have the Ancestral Channel be something to do with terrifying speed and alacrity. A combination of a mantis shrimp's bullet-fast strike and a sailfish's sheer speed.<br /> <br /> For the remaining Descendant Channel, I find myself at a bit of a loss. <br /> <br /> <u><b>Sanctity</b></u><br /> <br /> Again, Sanctity is tricky. I really Can't think of anything for the Ancestral Channels. Anything I can think of either belongs to a Descendant Channel, as a thing of the Cult or to Awareness.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T17:01:58-08:00","id":1170319,"title":"","content":"<u>[Stub]</u><br /> <br /> <u><b>Self-Serving Idol of Glory (Ancestral Channel)</b></u><br /> <i>The Leviathan is no mere creature of flesh and bone, but a living god capable of empowering icons made in their honor.</i><br /> <br /> The Leviathan's Divine nature empowers and curses objects in their vicinity.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 1:</b> Birthright of Sanctity<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 2:</b> The Leviathan may distribute up to their Sheol in equipment bonuses or increased weapon damage (to a maximum of 5) to objects in their immediate possession, as the items become sanctified by the Leviathan's Divine presence. These bonuses last until the end of the Scene, or if the Leviathan spends an Instant action and changes targets.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 3:</b> Curses now flow outward, striking down foes blasphemous tools. The Leviathan can degrade the equipment bonus or weapon damage of up to Sheol items in their line of sight, reducing their bonus by Sheol/2, round up (to a minimum equipment or damage bonus of 0). These penalties last until the end of the Scene, or if the Leviathan spends a point of Willpower to changes targets.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 4:</b> [Need a good item boost idea]<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 5: </b>Wrath falls upon whatever mortal artifice would dare impede a living god. For 1 Willpower, the Leviathan can make a Presence + Crafts roll with a damage bonus of Sheol to deal points of Structure damage (bypassing Durability) to any non-supernatural object that has harmed or otherwise obstructed their person this Scene. Supernatural objects can still be dealt damage, but do not have their Durability ignored.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 6:</b> Blessings now flow through onto the Leviathan's followers. By succeeding at a Meditation roll, the Leviathan can grant a number of equipment bonuses or increased weapon damage equal to Sheol * Presence (to a maximum of 5 - the Knowledge penalty of the recipient) among their Cult's (or, rarely, other people's) items, divided as they choose. These objects must have been in some way dedicated to Leviathan, such as by having one of their names or depictions inscribed upon it, or being used in a Ritual. These bonuses last until the end of the Scene (or day, for an additional Willpower point), the item leaves the Leviathan's Wake, or the Leviathan cancels the effect.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 7:</b> A Leviathan in Apotheosis can declare specific items or entire categories of object anathema to their presence. Succeed at a Meditation roll and spend 1 Willpower, then define either specific items (such as Gregor's car, or the lab vial with my blood) or a fairly specific category of items (such as bronze swords, or fabric the color red). All such objects within the Leviathan's Wake are treated as if they were a character in an Extreme Environment with a rating equal the the Leviathan's Presence, and their Durability treated as Stamina. The effect lasts for 1 day, until the item leaves the Leviathan's Wake, the Leviathan changes Depth, or if the Leviathan chooses to cancel the effect.<br /> <br /> [<u>Comments</u>: Maybe I should add Presence to Depth 5's damage, or just actually make it an attack roll? Might make the 6 and 7 Depth powers restricted to the current Scene's actors, and save the wide area effects for Rituals. Their general powers should be fine as is, though.]<br /> <br /> <b>Sidebar: Ancient Gods and Modern Marvels</b><br /> So, how compatible is the Bronze Age divine power of the Wicked Tribe and recent technological innovation? That's up to the Storyteller. Sure, most of Tiamat's brood has their power sourced in flesh, blood, and brute psychic might, but the School of Sand would very much state that isn't all there is, or at least, must be. One thing that is important to note regarding this Channel, though - items properly warded, such as Marduk's technology, items soaked in or serving as a focus for Virtue, or simply other supernatural protective measures, are resistant or outright immune. Additionally, objects conducting enough electrical current to cause damage may qualify, or at least be immune to Leviathans of less Sheol than the damage their current would deal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 12-25-2017, 08:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T17:07:54-08:00","id":1170320,"title":"","content":"Man I have a burning need for might channels....and vitality channels.<br /> But mostly might channels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8fsIR2T.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13566-kalzky","name":"Kalzky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13566_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T17:29:10-08:00","id":1170322,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kalzky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170320#post1170320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Man I have a burning need for might channels....and vitality channels.<br /> But mostly might channels.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the old &quot;straight bonus to Attribute&quot; Channels are gone, but you could still do something related to Strength or a Speed (closer to Celerity). Might also had Mind In Motion for telekinesis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T02:48:22-08:00","id":1170394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170319#post1170319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>[Stub]</u><br /> <br /> <u><b>Living Temple (Ancestral Channel)</b></u><br /> <i>The Leviathan is no mere creature of flesh and bone, but a living god capable of empowering icons made in their honor.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Much as I like the concept - and it's a nice idea to put it in Sanctity - the ichor expenditure makes this one automatically a Descendant Channel. Also, perhaps the name could be changed to something like 'Self-Serving Idol of Glory' or something? The 'Living Temple' thing gives me an idea for an Ancestral Sanctity Channel that lets a leviathan do a Jonah's Whale thing, literally acting as a living temple to his Cult in Depth 7. Like, space-warped insides with cathedral-esque pillars of bone and sinew and such. Mind you I'm not sure what the lower Depths would do. Maybe let the leviathan's Wake have some kind of weird primordial Feng Shui-type effect, enhancing the efforts of people within it that would benefit the leviathan directly (e.g. a cultist going to get supplies for the cult) while hindering those who would oppose them. Maybe providing a bonus to rituals?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T03:26:10-08:00","id":1170400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170394#post1170394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Much as I like the concept - and it's a nice idea to put it in Sanctity - the ichor expenditure makes this one automatically a Descendant Channel. Also, perhaps the name could be changed to something like 'Self-Serving Idol of Glory' or something?</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought Ichor costs were allowed. Guess not. I can probably change the abilities to require rolls and Willpower, then. The earlier ones are fairly minor, except at higher Sheol (in which case your other powers still outshine them). I'll change the name, though.<br /> <br /> Ideas on the Depth 4 effect?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170394#post1170394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The 'Living Temple' thing gives me an idea for an Ancestral Sanctity Channel that lets a leviathan do a Jonah's Whale thing, literally acting as a living temple to his Cult in Depth 7. Like, space-warped insides with cathedral-esque pillars of bone and sinew and such. Mind you I'm not sure what the lower Depths would do. Maybe let the leviathan's Wake have some kind of weird primordial Feng Shui-type effect, enhancing the efforts of people within it that would benefit the leviathan directly (e.g. a cultist going to get supplies for the cult) while hindering those who would oppose them. Maybe providing a bonus to rituals?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm. At that point, maybe make it an Adaptation? Maybe to something like Magnanimous Host to All at greater Depths?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T04:55:20-08:00","id":1170406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170400#post1170400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I thought Ichor costs were allowed. Guess not. I can probably change the abilities to require rolls and Willpower, then. The earlier ones are fairly minor, except at higher Sheol (in which case your other powers still outshine them). I'll change the name, though.<br /> <br /> Ideas on the Depth 4 effect?</div> </div> </div> </div>It was my understanding that Ancestral Channels were purely passive and functioned independently of Ichor while Descendant ones required it. The thing about Ichor is that it's comparatively hard to gather lots of it and you need to spend it to transform, so you're effectively already paying Ichor. Rolls and Willpower are sufficient, I think, although Willpower should only be required for the greater powers. The Depth 3 power probably only needs a Willpower cost to change targets, although you should probably make it so that it applies (Sheol/2 rounded up) as a penalty to (Sheol) targets for simplicity of understanding. That's still a hefty penalty at higher Sheol. Also, when you say 'by meditating' you'll need to define how long the interval of the extended action of meditation takes, as well as probably clarifying what you mean. Maybe phrase it as 'With a successful Meditation roll'.<br /> <br /> For Depth 5... Maybe make it so that blessed items retain their powers for hours equal to (Sheol) after the scene ends or indefinitely so long as the leviathan remains in Depth 5 or greater, and the leviathan can add (Sheol*2) points worth of Equipment Bonuses or Damage (up to 5 per object).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170400#post1170400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm. At that point, maybe make it an Adaptation? Maybe to something like Magnanimous Host to All at greater Depths?</div> </div> </div> </div>It probably would be better as an Adaptation. Maybe it's got a few different versions which provide different amounts of space inside the Leviathan, from a smallish room to a full-on cathedral, running from 3 to 7 points:<ul><li>OOO - 2m*2m*2m room (8m3)</li> <li>OOOO - 5m*5m*5m room (125m3)</li> <li>OOOOO - 10m*10m*10m room (1000m3)</li> <li>OOOOO O - 25m*25m*25m room (15625m3)</li> <li>OOOOO OO - 50m*50m*50m room (125000m3)</li> </ul>With the ability to redistribute those dimensions, of course. So you could have one roughly cubic room, or a really long corridor or whatever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 12-25-2017, 08:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T04:09:47-08:00","id":1171762,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170319#post1170319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u><b>Self-Serving Idol of Glory (Ancestral Channel)</b></u></div> </div> </div> </div>If this is to be an ancestral power the bonuses should also be automatic, properly constructed ritual items power up in the Leviathan's presence, and it should be limited to primitive technology. You construct the ritual knife like normal equipment, and if it's in the Leviathan's presence it gets the appropriate bonus.<br /> <br /> The real problem is that normal weapons go up to damage 5, Leviathan claws go up to damage 7. It wouldn't be right for an enhanced knife to do more damage than a Leviathan in Apothosis (I admit I'm not counting size bonuses). That means the Channel either provides &quot;sidegrades&quot; (which could work but I don't have idea at the top of my head). Otherwise it would be limited to making cheap homemade throwing spears into weapons on par with a shotgun. Which while thematic sounds severely underpowered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T07:06:23-08:00","id":1171781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1171762#post1171762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If this is to be an ancestral power the bonuses should also be automatic, properly constructed ritual items power up in the Leviathan's presence, and it should be limited to primitive technology. You construct the ritual knife like normal equipment, and if it's in the Leviathan's presence it gets the appropriate bonus.<br /> <br /> The real problem is that normal weapons go up to damage 5, Leviathan claws go up to damage 7. It wouldn't be right for an enhanced knife to do more damage than a Leviathan in Apothosis (I admit I'm not counting size bonuses). That means the Channel either provides &quot;sidegrades&quot; (which could work but I don't have idea at the top of my head). Otherwise it would be limited to making cheap homemade throwing spears into weapons on par with a shotgun. Which while thematic sounds severely underpowered.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I was targeting Ancestral mostly because there currently aren't any for Sanctity. The first draft fit Descendant better, but I've revised it to make it more Ancestral compliant. So, you are saying even the &quot;designate targets&quot; is too active for Ancestral?<br /> <br /> As for the bonuses, there is always the Armory points route that Mortal Devouring Armory went with.<br /> <br /> How does the following look, then?<br /> <br /> <u>Draft 3</u><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <u><b>Self-Serving Idol of Glory (Ancestral Channel)</b></u><br /> <i>The Leviathan is no mere creature of flesh and bone, but a living god capable of empowering icons made in their honor.</i><br /> <br /> The Leviathan's Divine nature empowers and curses objects in their vicinity.<br /> <b>Depth 1:</b> Birthright of Sanctity<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 2:</b> Items that the Leviathan has made partake of their divine nature. They gain 7 Dedication points to assign to the item, but only can access their current Depth in benefits, and only while they hold the item. The Leviathan can have up to Sheol in personally crafted items dedicated in this way, though they can destroy previous creations to make way for new ones.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 3:</b> The Leviathan can now blight a type of object with curses, reducing its effectiveness in their presence. They declare a category of item (such as medical tools, chain armor, swords, pistols, etc.) for each dot of Sheol anathema to them, and assign a pool of 7 Blight points to effects, though they can only utilize up to their current Depth in effects. The Leviathan can suppress this effect for the Scene for 1 Willpower. They can rededicate target items and blight effects after successfully meditating after 24 hours.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 4:</b> What the Leviathan has made with their own hands (or tentacles) is as much them as their own flesh. Dedicated items in the Leviathan's possession are treated as the Leviathan for the purposes of Size increases, and any effect that would manipulate the item is subject to a Clash of Wills.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 5: </b>Wrath falls upon whatever mortal artifice would dare impede a living god. Blighted items that strike or impede the Leviathan automatically take Sheol points of Structure damage (bypassing Durability). Supernatural objects can still be dealt damage, but do not have their Durability ignored.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 6:</b> Blessings now flow through onto the Leviathan's followers. Objects crafted by their Cult and dedicated to Leviathan, such as by having one of their names or depictions inscribed upon it or being used in a Ritual, can gain up to 7 Dedications as well, though the amount a user can access is limited further by their Knowledge of the Leviathan.<br /> <br /> <b>Depth 7:</b> A Leviathan in Apotheosis can expunge the presence of blasphemous object from their very presence. All Blighted objects within the Leviathan's Wake are treated as if they were a character in an Extreme Environment with a rating equal the the Leviathan's Presence, and their Durability treated as Stamina. The effect lasts until the item leaves the Leviathan's Wake, or the Leviathan changes Depth. <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"width: 500px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Dedication Cost</b></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Effect</b></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">+1 Equipment Bonus (max. +5 total)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">+1 Weapon Damage (max. 5 total)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">+1 Durability</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">2</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">+1 General or Ballistic Armor</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">2</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">9-Again on Skill rolls (or upgrade to 8-Again)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">3</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Exceptional Success on 3 Successes</td> </tr> </table></div> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"width: 500px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Blight Cost</b></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"><b>Effect</b></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">-1 Equipment Bonus (min. 0 total)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">-1 Weapon Damage (min. 0 total)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">-1 Durability (min. 0)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">2</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">-1 General or Ballistic Armor</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">2</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Lose 10-Again (or downgrade 9-Again)</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">3</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Failures become Dramatic Failures</td> </tr> </table></div> <b>Adaptations</b>:<br /> Divine Receptacle (\u2022\u2022): The Leviathan has access to an additional 1-dot Dedication - the ability to store Ichor inside the item. Items can only store Ichor up to their Durability safely.<br /> Channel the Divine (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022, Requires Divine Receptacle): The Leviathan has access to an additional variable cost Dedication - the item can replicate the ability of a Channel the Leviathan knows. The cost in Dedication points is equal to the Depth of the Channel ability. Any Ichor costs must be paid for from either the bearer, or the item's own reserve (through Divine Receptacle). Sheol is treated as 1 in the case where the bearer does not possess a Sheol Attribute (such as a favored cultist being given such an item).<br /> Primordial Creator (\u2022\u2022\u2022): The Leviathan gains 3 additional Dedication points and can access their Depth+1 at Depth 2, Depth+2 at Depth 4, and Depth+3 at Depth 6.<br /> Accursed Idol (\u2022\u2022\u2022): The Leviathan gains 3 additional Blight points and can access their Depth+1 at Depth 3, Depth+2 at Depth 5, and Depth+3 at Depth 7.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Might move the lower Depth powers into Adaptations. I didn't explicitly restrict the effects to primitive tools, but I'm kinda doubting most Leviathans or their cults possess the clean rooms or direct know-how for building modern electronics. Backyard blacksmith is more likely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 12-30-2017, 10:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T08:16:48-08:00","id":1171792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170120#post1170120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u><b>Awareness</b></u><br /> <br /> Well, we've only got one Descendant Channel left to do here, and it seems to me that about the only thing we're missing in Awareness is some kind of prophetic ability. Now, prophecy is always tricky to do in an RPG, so perhaps we could work with that to make something a little unique as prophetic powers go. What if, instead of having the Leviathan be a 'future-seer', they are a speaker of self-fulfilling prophecies - part prediction and part memetic instrument of will. In essence what I'm proposing is that the Leviathan's prophecy, by virtue of being spoken, increases the odds of a specific future happening partly by giving dice to those furthering it and partly by serving as a statement to the Storyteller of what the player wants, allowing them to work that into the story or present obstacles to it as necessary. The 'weight' a Leviathan can put behind their future increases with increasing Depth.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think there was a Divination Channel in 1E, or proposed earlier.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170120#post1170120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u><b>Elements</b></u><br /> <br /> Hmm. Well, passive Elements powers are tricky, but I have a couple of ideas. I did always like the old <i> Rain-Dance of the Tempest</i> Channel, so some kind of space-warping Channel based off of non-euclidean geometry seems like a good one, and fitting for Leviathan's themes. As for the other, what about a Channel that allows a degree of control over Resonance and Essence within the Wake? Leviathans predate most divisions, including presumably that between the flesh and the spirit. We could crib some powers from the Idigam's Essence-Shaping abilities. My only issue with that is that the power might be a too powerful to be a passive one, and it might be better as a Descendant Channel, which doesn't really help. Perhaps some kind of natural EMP/tech-disruption aura?</div> </div> </div> </div>What about some kind of Environmental Tilt generating Channel? Fogs, torrential rains, even flooding from nowhere?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170120#post1170120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u><b>Fecundity</b></u><br /> <br /> I've already proposed ideas for Fecundity above. With reference to the 'permanent minions' Channel idea, though, I did re-think it a little, and I'm proposing that we base it, again, off of the Idigam's Essence-Shaping abilities, albeit with a more fleshy 'spin'.</div> </div> </div> </div>Could work for mechanics. Idigam Essence Shaping is pretty powerful, though.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170120#post1170120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u><b>Predation</b></u><br /> <br /> I propose a stealth-booster, escalating to effective invisibility, as per the old <i>Stalker's Shifting Hide. </i>It was a good one. That said, it might be better to shift that up to Descendant and maybe have the Ancestral Channel be something to do with terrifying speed and alacrity. A combination of a mantis shrimp's bullet-fast strike and a sailfish's sheer speed.<br /> <br /> For the remaining Descendant Channel, I find myself at a bit of a loss.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah. I was think maybe a tracking power (because <i>Predation</i>), but those are probably better in Awareness. Any other predator niches that aren't already covered?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1170120#post1170120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u><b>Sanctity</b></u><br /> <br /> Again, Sanctity is tricky. I really Can't think of anything for the Ancestral Channels. Anything I can think of either belongs to a Descendant Channel, as a thing of the Cult or to Awareness.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe something that distorts the Wake into being able inflict other Conditions? Social modifiers are kinda hard, since the greater the Depth, the more monstrous the Leviathan, which counteracts positive vibes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-30T08:23:43-08:00","id":1171796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1171792#post1171792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think there was a Divination Channel in 1E, or proposed earlier.</div> </div> </div> </div>There was one in 1E which allowed post- and pre-cognition, with the 'distance' from the present determined by Depth. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1171792#post1171792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about some kind of Environmental Tilt generating Channel? Fogs, torrential rains, even flooding from nowhere?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, we've got torrential rains and floods covered with Sky Cauldron and Being of Primordial Waters. Fogs used to be covered by the Elemental Birthright.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1171792#post1171792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could work for mechanics. Idigam Essence Shaping is pretty powerful, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is; it was just a thought.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1171792#post1171792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah. I was think maybe a tracking power (because <i>Predation</i>), but those are probably better in Awareness. Any other predator niches that aren't already covered?</div> </div> </div> </div>There used to be a Predation Channel related to tracking. As for predator niches, what about some kind of pack-creating Channel, one that allows a group aiding you to coordinate in pursuit of prey? Although that could be Sanctity as well. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T13:56:30-08:00","id":1172732,"title":"","content":"Er guys. The Key and the Gate is the new divination channel.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1171796#post1171796\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fogs used to be covered by the Elemental Birthright.</div> </div> </div> </div> Still might be. It's a pretty useful power to compensate a little for how unsubbtle the tribe can be.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1171781#post1171781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How does the following look, then?</div> </div> </div> </div> I'm not sure how useful it would be in play but it seems solid enough. The Depth 4 effect with size seems weird though; Leviathans shouldn't be useing giant tools, especially since they're unlikely to even fit a trilobyte body. I'd say at Depth 4 that should be the point where you start giving abilities to Beloved.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1171781#post1171781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">but I'm kinda doubting most Leviathans or their cults possess the clean rooms or direct know-how for building modern electronics. Backyard blacksmith is more likely.</div> </div> </div> </div>That doesn't matter. The thematics of Leviathans being limited to primitive/occult technology is equally valid no matter how much skill is required to build modern electronics.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1171781#post1171781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could work for mechanics. Idigam Essence Shaping is pretty powerful, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>For essence shaping look at Everflowing Fetid Growth. I'd suggest a grab-bag of different powers like the Elements ones now. Tempoary buffs (with a drawback), Environmental Tilts, that sort of thing. Actually permemently transforming someone should have could be Depth 6 or 7.<br /> <br /> Buffs are Rituals' thing, so a Channel to do them should have serious drawbacks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T14:05:39-08:00","id":1172739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1172732#post1172732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Er guys. The Key and the Gate is the new divination channel.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought that was purely postcognitive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T00:37:17-08:00","id":1172943,"title":"","content":"You hit precognative at Depth 6.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T03:09:35-08:00","id":1172957,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1172943#post1172943\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You hit precognative at Depth 6.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, I stand corrected. It could probably use some clarification, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T10:45:48-08:00","id":1173040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1172732#post1172732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure how useful it would be in play but it seems solid enough. The Depth 4 effect with size seems weird though; Leviathans shouldn't be useing giant tools, especially since they're unlikely to even fit a trilobyte body. I'd say at Depth 4 that should be the point where you start giving abilities to Beloved.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then what to use for the Depth 6 effect? Are there any specific effects tied to a Leviathan's &quot;Temple&quot; that could be leveraged?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1172732#post1172732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That doesn't matter. The thematics of Leviathans being limited to primitive/occult technology is equally valid no matter how much skill is required to build modern electronics.</div> </div> </div> </div>But what is &quot;primitive&quot;? The term is pretty arbitrary. Specific materials used might work, but then, why those? Possibly only things (initially) made <i>from</i> the Leviathan.<br /> <br /> Reducing it down to &quot;made from scratch&quot; keeps the personal, limited feel with throwing arbitrary restrictions on it. If a dedicated member of the School of Sand wants to sink the effort and cost into the &quot;in-house&quot; infrastructure necessary for some degree of technological development, why throw a hard block at them? The cost considerations would limit it to basic, &quot;primitive&quot; tech anyways.<br /> <br /> Aside: what are your thoughts on limiting the &quot;other people&quot; boons/Dedications based on Knowledge? The exact situation I had in mind (other than as a power limiter) was that such objects were more powerful in the hands of the cult itself, and powerless (or nearly so) in the hands of &quot;non-believers&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T09:45:05-08:00","id":1175198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1173040#post1173040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then what to use for the Depth 6 effect? Are there any specific effects tied to a Leviathan's &quot;Temple&quot; that could be leveraged?</div> </div> </div> </div> No idea I'm afraid.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1173040#post1173040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But what is &quot;primitive&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div> Defining primitive is easy. No chemical reactions, electricity, or moving parts. That covers just about anything you'll expect to see a uncontact amazon tribe using.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1173040#post1173040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">why throw a hard block at them?</div> </div> </div> </div> For thematic reasons. Lovecraftian mosters are considered to be the antithesis of reason, even looking upon one can drive you mad, and advanced tools are the product of reason.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1173040#post1173040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aside: what are your thoughts on limiting the &quot;other people&quot; boons/Dedications based on Knowledge?</div> </div> </div> </div>Given that this will be a passive effect that depends upon depth it would simplify things enormously if the effect is limited to what's happening on screen.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-12T08:43:59-08:00","id":1175472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175198#post1175198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Defining primitive is easy. No chemical reactions</div> </div> </div> </div>I could be cheeky and point out that fire is a chemical reaction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-12T16:30:07-08:00","id":1175601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175198#post1175198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For thematic reasons. Lovecraftian mosters are considered to be the antithesis of <b>reason</b>, even looking upon one can drive you mad, and advanced tools are the product of <u>reason</u>.</div> </div> </div> </div>I... don't think those are the same definitions for reason being used in those cases.<br /> <br /> Regardless, what about (either Depth power, or Adaptation) allowing the creation of &quot;advanced technology&quot; powered solely through the Leviathan's divine might? Like a stone that acts like a computer, or a blowgun that operates more like a (admittedly bolt-action) firearm, due to &quot;magic&quot;? It works, even if it doesn't make sense as to how it does. Would that be in theme?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175198#post1175198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given that this will be a passive effect that depends upon depth it would simplify things enormously if the effect is limited to what's happening on screen.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, limit the empowerment to object in the current Scene, cut the longer term empowerment and restricting by Knowledge? Maybe allow an Adaptation (or build a Ritual for it) to have longer term empowerment of objects?<br /> <br /> One of the things I did want, though, was for it to be useful for Ophion cults.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-13T01:45:50-08:00","id":1175714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175601#post1175601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Regardless, what about (either Depth power, or Adaptation) allowing the creation of &quot;advanced technology&quot; powered solely through the Leviathan's divine might? Like a stone that acts like a computer, or a blowgun that operates more like a (admittedly bolt-action) firearm, due to &quot;magic&quot;? It works, even if it doesn't make sense as to how it does. Would that be in theme?</div> </div> </div> </div>I second this. It would be rather evocative of the Lovecraftian races like the Elder Things and the Great Race of Yith, who used hyper-advanced science.<br /> <br /> Whatever you create would have to be non-replicable, clearly linked to the Leviathan though cult symbols etc and only usable by Beloved, to distinguish it from Marduk's hypertechnology. Also, there would have to be some kind of restriction on what exactly you can create. Replicating something like a gun would work, as would a high-speed conveyance ('vimana' comes to mind) but if you can make communications devices that undermines some of Leviathan's themes, as would being able to go beyond what is possible with current technology. Actually, the more I think about this the more it sounds like an Evolution, one derived from the School of Sand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T07:34:49-08:00","id":1175970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175472#post1175472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could be cheeky and point out that fire is a chemical reaction.</div> </div> </div> </div>And the anthesis of water. Haven't you heard, never give the GM ideas ;P<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175601#post1175601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would that be in theme?</div> </div> </div> </div> It would be more in theme for it to work in weird occult ways. A blowgun that causes squirmious horrors to eat their way out of your flesh. A computer works on the intelligence and hard work of the programmer. But that stone tablet might work on an equivalent exchange of blood for answers.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175601#post1175601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, limit the empowerment to object in the current Scene, cut the longer term empowerment and restricting by Knowledge? Maybe allow an Adaptation (or build a Ritual for it) to have longer term empowerment of objects?</div> </div> </div> </div> But what I want to avoid is a Beloved strike team's equipment suddenly gaining or loosing power as the Leviathan shifts through the Depths.<br /> <br /> IMO that would be really annoying to keep track of. Either in the sense that the player has to keep track of whether reverting to human form will hurt a strike team currently out on a mission; or if you're playing the strike team.<br /> <br /> Long term empowerment with rituals is fine though. Since a Ritual's duration is independent of whatever the Leviathan happens to be doing at any given time.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175714#post1175714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I second this. It would be rather evocative of the Lovecraftian races like the Elder Things and the Great Race of Yith, who used hyper-advanced science.</div> </div> </div> </div> There's a place for strange science in Leviathan, and not just in Marduk's hand. After all, there's already scientifically advanced civilisations on the sea floor in the write up.<br /> <br /> But anything created by a Channel should work on different lines to science. It shouldn't be a computer with a different aesthetic, but something that works on different occult priciples. And if the mechanics are complicated it's probably better to put under Rituals.<br /> <br /> (And yes, an Evolution can break the thematic rules)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T10:29:04-08:00","id":1175998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175970#post1175970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would be more in theme for it to work in weird occult ways. A blowgun that causes squirmious horrors to eat their way out of your flesh. A computer works on the intelligence and hard work of the programmer. But that stone tablet might work on an equivalent exchange of blood for answers.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Why isn't it working?&quot;<br /> &quot;You know how there are different layouts for keyboard inputs, like QWERTY, Dvork, etc.?&quot;<br /> &quot;Yeah?&quot;<br /> &quot;Well, the Stone of Answers takes AB+, not O-.&quot;<br /> &quot;...I'm going to need to find another sacrifice...&quot;<br /> <br /> So, equivalent tools (to use for the appropriate applications, like surgery, combat, or research) are allowed, provided they are sufficiently weird?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175970#post1175970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But what I want to avoid is a Beloved strike team's equipment suddenly gaining or loosing power as the Leviathan shifts through the Depths.<br /> <br /> IMO that would be really annoying to keep track of. Either in the sense that the player has to keep track of whether reverting to human form will hurt a strike team currently out on a mission; or if you're playing the strike team.<br /> <br /> Long term empowerment with rituals is fine though. Since a Ritual's duration is independent of whatever the Leviathan happens to be doing at any given time.</div> </div> </div> </div>So keep the Channel's direct effects limit to the current Scene to keep track of easier. So Cult Ritual Knives and such might get empowered by the revealed presence of their god, but are just poorly made flint the building over?<br /> <hr /><br /> More generally, how are Ancestral Channels useful to Ophions (since they are &quot;trapped&quot; in the Rift), or rather, their Cults? Powers that rely on a Leviathan's presence aren't going to have much use if the Leviathan can't be present. Or are they supposed to be merely limited to acting as Ritual batteries?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-14T13:20:16-08:00","id":1176039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175998#post1175998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, equivalent tools (to use for the appropriate applications, like surgery, combat, or research) are allowed, provided they are sufficiently weird?</div> </div> </div> </div> Well I still think that anything complicated should be under Rituals rather than a channel.<br /> <br /> A stone knife or bronze that cuts like modern steel is fine. A ritual mask that demands respect (think a tailored suit) is fine. But that stone tablet should probably abstracted into the ritual system where spilling blood across the tablet or into the mouth of fish who sing prophecy is equivalent.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175998#post1175998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So keep the Channel's direct effects limit to the current Scene to keep track of easier. So Cult Ritual Knives and such might get empowered by the revealed presence of their god, but are just poorly made flint the building over?</div> </div> </div> </div> Yep.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1175998#post1175998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or are they supposed to be merely limited to acting as Ritual batteries?</div> </div> </div> </div>This one. Ophions are ritual batteries, and plot hook McGuffins. Stop The Sheol 10+ monster returning to the surface.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-15T13:36:33-08:00","id":1176377,"title":"","content":"I was watching a lore video or two on <i>Bloodborne</i> the other day and a thought occurred to me for one of the Ancestral Fecundity Channels. Would it be possible to have a Channel that fulfils the twin functions of allowing a Leviathan to simulate the mutagenic and healing powers of the Old Blood and simultaneously get around the fact that there are some players - myself included - who would like to have a Lahmasu Cult (or at least a Cult with a Lahmasu arm) without having to sexually exploit our Beloved because squick. Going out and recruiting Lahmasu is an option, of course, but that relies upon the ST having a group of Lahmasu who are willing to join you or can be persuaded to, and this may not be easily workable into a given campaign.<br /> <br /> Essentially, what I'm proposing is a 'healing with a price' channel, where the Leviathan can exude a fluid - or maybe it's just in their blood - that has healing properties, at the price of short-term mutation, Breaking Points and vulnerability to the Wake. All of these factors increase as Depth increases, until at Apotheosis the mutations are permanent, essentially cannibalising Integrity in exchange for planting a 'seed' of Ichor in the individual, transforming them into true Lahmasu. There would have to be limitations on how long the substance can be separated from the Leviathan and still maintain its potency, of course, but does this sound workable? if so, I could have a go at writing up a full Channel sometime next week.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-16T03:52:11-08:00","id":1176482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1176377#post1176377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was watching a lore video or two on <i>Bloodborne</i> the other day and a thought occurred to me for one of the Ancestral Fecundity Channels. Would it be possible to have a Channel that fulfils the twin functions of allowing a Leviathan to simulate the mutagenic and healing powers of the Old Blood and simultaneously get around the fact that there are some players - myself included - who would like to have a Lahmasu Cult (or at least a Cult with a Lahmasu arm) without having to sexually exploit our Beloved because squick. Going out and recruiting Lahmasu is an option, of course, but that relies upon the ST having a group of Lahmasu who are willing to join you or can be persuaded to, and this may not be easily workable into a given campaign.<br /> <br /> Essentially, what I'm proposing is a 'healing with a price' channel, where the Leviathan can exude a fluid - or maybe it's just in their blood - that has healing properties, at the price of short-term mutation, Breaking Points and vulnerability to the Wake. All of these factors increase as Depth increases, until at Apotheosis the mutations are permanent, essentially cannibalising Integrity in exchange for planting a 'seed' of Ichor in the individual, transforming them into true Lahmasu. There would have to be limitations on how long the substance can be separated from the Leviathan and still maintain its potency, of course, but does this sound workable? if so, I could have a go at writing up a full Channel sometime next week.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think healing is already in one of the new/converted Channels, but I'm not sure about the mutation aspect. Maybe the permanent change to Lahmasu would be best done as a Ritual (with the Channel serving as the conceptual and mechanical base). I know a combo of Channels and Adaptations in 1E let you eat someone and rebirth them as your (optionally different) clone/offspring.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-16T04:30:08-08:00","id":1176485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1176482#post1176482\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think healing is already in one of the new/converted Channels, but I'm not sure about the mutation aspect. Maybe the permanent change to Lahmasu would be best done as a Ritual (with the Channel serving as the conceptual and mechanical base). I know a combo of Channels and Adaptations in 1E let you eat someone and rebirth them as your (optionally different) clone/offspring.</div> </div> </div> </div>I remember the latter part (it was an Adaptation of Birthing the Second Self, IIRC), and I concede that Lahamsuification (that's quite a word) might be better done as a Ritual. It was just an idea for filling those slots. It was based off of the inspiration I mentioned and the old Fecundity Birthright. I don't recall any 'heal other' Channels in 2e, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-17T11:58:58-08:00","id":1176811,"title":"","content":"Healing others is Depth 3 of the Hydra's Rebirth. And it can result in the recepient having Hybrid children. But turning people in Lahamsu would indeed be a Ritual.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T09:05:18-08:00","id":1176970,"title":"","content":"Is there space for a mini-Dark Era related to the Bronze Age Collapse?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-18T18:41:05-08:00","id":1177118,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar134_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"134\" data-vbnamecard=\"134\">The Kings Raven</a> <b>Re: Self-Serving Idol of Glory</b><br /> Are there any/many touch-based powers in other Channels? Or likely for Sanctity, especially? I was thinking for the Depth 6 power being able to treat a/any object dedicated to them that is within their Wake as if it were &quot;them&quot; for the purposes of supernatural abilities. Touch powers acting through touching it, allow it at act as a proxy for the Depth 4 effect (so the Leviathan doesn't have to be in the room, risking themselves - just nearby), etc. Probably will take Willpower, last a Scene, and put the Leviathan in a trance while focusing? They'd need Awareness to actually &quot;see&quot; what they are targeting, otherwise they are &quot;firing blind&quot;. Or &quot;acting on faith&quot;, if you will.<br /> <br /> Might be too Ritual-lite, but I thought I'd ask. The Depth 7 power current has a range of &quot;Wake&quot; so I tried to think of something similar, but still limited.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-03T14:37:16-08:00","id":1182070,"title":"","content":"Can (and if so, how roughly) would:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>A Cult or individual send their fears, neuroses, dreams, etc. to the Rift (where that would then incarnate as various sea creatures, but that is largely incidental). Possible reasons might be to just get rid of unwanted traits, or it could be to feed a Leviathan that is in the Rift (like an Ophion).</li> <li>Connect the Rift to a mortals mind. Either Oneiros, Dream Bastion, or equivalent. So they could flood it with various Rift Thought-Creatures, or grant a Leviathan access to the mortal. (I know Beloved are considered part of the Leviathans mind already - this is more to &quot;infect&quot; a non-cultist mortal)<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Related - How would they form a bridge to the Temenos or local Dream, to affect area changes?</li> </ol></li> <li>Designate a location or object as an emanation point of a Leviathan's Wake.</li> <li>Create a Temple bigger on the inside than out.</li> </ol><hr /><br /> What are some other Descendant Sanctity or Might Ideas?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 02-03-2018, 05:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T10:09:33-08:00","id":1183989,"title":"","content":"If you haven't already, I recommend putting <i>Bloodborne</i> in the 'inspirational media' section. The Fishing Hamlet deserves special mention.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T04:57:01-08:00","id":1184332,"title":"","content":"Makes sense, but I haven't played Bloodborn. PS exclusive <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1182070#post1182070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[*]A Cult or individual send their fears, neuroses, dreams, etc. to the Rift (where that would then incarnate as various sea creatures, but that is largely incidental). Possible reasons might be to just get rid of unwanted traits, or it could be to feed a Leviathan that is in the Rift (like an Ophion).</div> </div> </div> </div> To some extent this happens automatically. But powers that increase your mental health are out of theme.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1182070#post1182070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[*]Connect the Rift to a mortals mind. Either Oneiros, Dream Bastion, or equivalent. So they could flood it with various Rift Thought-Creatures, or grant a Leviathan access to the mortal. (I know Beloved are considered part of the Leviathans mind already - this is more to &quot;infect&quot; a non-cultist mortal)[LIST=1][*]Related - How would they form a bridge to the Temenos or local Dream, to affect area changes?</div> </div> </div> </div> This is a plot level ability rather than a power IMO.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1182070#post1182070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[*]Designate a location or object as an emanation point of a Leviathan's Wake.</div> </div> </div> </div> Channels. E.G. By possessing a Beloved. Leviathans shouldn't be able to move the emination point away from the body they're inhabiting otherwise it's too easy.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1182070#post1182070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[*]Create a Temple bigger on the inside than out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Elements Ritual.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T04:59:58-08:00","id":1184333,"title":"","content":"While working on my Dark Era fan project, I noticed some of the channels of the first edition did not make it to 2e master doc. Is it intentional?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23621-tg0098","name":"tg0098","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23621_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T05:38:32-08:00","id":1184343,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1184332#post1184332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To some extent this happens automatically. But powers that increase your mental health are out of theme.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I'm not sure cutting out portions of your psyche to feed to some extra-dimensional fish-god could be considered &quot;mentally healthy&quot;. You still aren't actually dealing with issues, and there are bound to be side-effects.<br /> <br /> Possible example:<br /> \u200b* You are left a bit more emotionally &quot;cold&quot; and find it difficult to empathize.<br /> * Your (and others) cast off neruoses have found a Gatewater and are returning to trouble the area.<br /> * Nature (even Supernature) abhors a vaccuum - for each unwanted issue you've cast out, another takes up residence. From the area, from the Rift in general...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1184332#post1184332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is a plot level ability rather than a power IMO.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even just the &quot;Eel-God is now visiting the Occult Investigator's dreams&quot; one?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1184332#post1184332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Channels. E.G. By possessing a Beloved. Leviathans shouldn't be able to move the emination point away from the body they're inhabiting otherwise it's too easy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't mean move the Wake <i>away</i>, as much as &quot;the Wake also emanates from this point&quot; (to a greater-or-lesser degree). Again, methods for distant (or Rift-bound) Leviathans to sanity-blast people (and use any other effect that might be tied to the Wake).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1184332#post1184332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Elements Ritual.</div> </div> </div> </div>Based on (the as-yet-unconverted) Rain-Dance of the Tempest?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T05:43:39-08:00","id":1184344,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1184332#post1184332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Makes sense, but I haven't played Bloodborn. PS exclusive <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Me neither, if I'm honest, but I've seen quite a few playthroughs on YouTube and the Fishing Hamlet just strikes me as the eventual endpoint of an unfortunate village taken over by Lahmasu to a dead Leviathan (in this case Kos, or some say Kosm...)<br /> <br /> The Hamlet.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px