s":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-21T03:20:52-08:00","id":1436395,"title":"","content":"Okay, so, I really like this project (even if I'm not going to get all that involved in it), so has anyone tried to create a full-on sample character for each combination of Strain and School? As in a full character sheet and description (and/or image) of each of their depths? The reason I ask this is because I'd really like to see the sorts of directions you lot would take in terms of the characters thusly created.<br /> <br /> If not, then I'd be all too willing to wait. I'm not good at creating characters, so I'm afraid that I'd have little input to add.<br /> <br /> If its already been done, could someone direct me to them (or at least provide links please).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-21T11:51:45-08:00","id":1436423,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TerrorCooper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1436395#post1436395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, so, I really like this project (even if I'm not going to get all that involved in it), so has anyone tried to create a full-on sample character for each combination of Strain and School? As in a full character sheet and description (and/or image) of each of their depths? The reason I ask this is because I'd really like to see the sorts of directions you lot would take in terms of the characters thusly created.<br /> <br /> If not, then I'd be all too willing to wait. I'm not good at creating characters, so I'm afraid that I'd have little input to add.<br /> <br /> If its already been done, could someone direct me to them (or at least provide links please).</div> </div> </div> </div>Not that I know of, though there were, IIRC, some Leviathan characters in the Antagonists chapter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-23T05:57:04-08:00","id":1436676,"title":"","content":"Huh... okay then. I'm all to willing to wait.<br /> <br /> Still, there <i>are</i> a total of forty-nine (49) possible characters if one doesn't include the School of Thunder (fifty-six (56) if you do), which is quite a bit. So I'm willing to wait quite a while for my request to be fulfilled.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-20T15:45:19-07:00","id":1440760,"title":"","content":"Okay, so I was combing through the merits section of Chapter Six (6), and I had this thought when reading the 'Narrow Wake' and 'Wide Wake' Merits; 'Okay, but what happens if someone playing Leviathan tries to take the both of these for the same character? Would the two merits just cancel each other out? Or are they actually exclusive? Would the changes in effective Sheol negate each other while still leaving the Wake Diameter altered?'<br /> <br /> If this has already been covered, then I apologize, retract the questions and humbly request a link to the answer. If not, then what're your answers?<br /> <br /> I'd also like to inquire as to why nobody seems to have thought of adding in a Lexicon, Glossary, Dictionary or anything else along those lines to aid newcomers in quickly gaining a basic understanding of the various terms used?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-01T20:36:57-07:00","id":1446899,"title":"","content":"I am starting to see a lot of overlap with L:TCC with Bloodborne: The Old Hunters regarding the Fishing Hamlet's inhabitants and Kos","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5450-the-son-of-the-swordfish","name":"The Son of the Swordfish","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-31T16:09:39-07:00","id":1455882,"title":"","content":"Sorry about the possible thread necromancy here, but I was thinking:<br /> 1. Is this project still being worked on, or is the current version as good as we are going to get?<br /> 2. Is there any plans for homebrew Contagion Chronicle support for Leviathans? It should be fairly straightforward. I think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26101-grevnor","name":"Grevnor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-01T05:37:39-07:00","id":1455927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bb