ank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T09:10:00-07:00","id":1487389,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/434590-leviathan-the-cult-chronicles?p=1486879#post1486879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, while I'm not great at creating my own artwork, I'm trying to find something that might be fitting to use as border for this sheet. Anyone have some thoughts on what you'd like to see as far as a border graphic goes?<br /> <br /> I'm not totally sure what the vibe of the game is, so I'm not sure what to start looking for graphics wise..</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not deeply involved, but having read the current material and TVTropes page, the general vibe strikes me as:<br /> <br /> - solemn, Lovecraft-esque antiquity and divinity<br /> - weight of history, longing for lost golden age, demands set up by ancestors<br /> - dysfunctional family dynamics<br /> <br /> So I'd imagine something inspired by Bronze Age temple plaques and gravings with geneological tree motif.<br /> Someone more involved in the project might correct me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27482,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27482-mithrill","user":"Mithrill","date":". 07-21-2022, 12:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27482-mithrill","name":"Mithrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Jo